window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a411-6c3382e47bb0cf68.json"]={sha256:"6c3382e47bb0cf680a57b7c26e92df2010b0a523359da3730756f2547d0d492f",value:{"id":"a411","title":"磁流變光學拋光","titleEn":"Magnetorheological optical finishing","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從羰基鐵粒子在磁場中成鏈、形成具降伏應力的流體帶談起，用 Preston 關係與 D 形去除點建立磁流變拋光的去除模型，再把拋光輪、流體黏度閉迴路、工件材料與次表面損傷、干涉量測與去除點校正、誤差預算，直到清洗與驗收交接，整合成一條可重複的非球面修形流程。","summaryEn":"Start with carbonyl-iron particles chaining in a magnetic field into a ribbon with a yield stress, model removal with the Preston relation and the D-shaped spot, then integrate the wheel, fluid-viscosity loop, workpiece materials and subsurface damage, interferometry and spot calibration, error budget, cleaning and acceptance into a repeatable aspheric figuring process.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-design-fabrication","subcategoryTitle":"光學設計與精密加工","subcategoryTitleEn":"Optical design and precision fabrication","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-design-fabrication","learningTags":["optics","optics-design-fabrication","fabrication"],"architectureFamily":"fabrication","architectureNodes":[["磁流變液與調節迴路","MR fluid and conditioning loop"],["電磁鐵與拋光輪","Electromagnet and polishing wheel"],["多軸數控平台","Multi-axis CNC stage"],["非球面工件","Aspheric workpiece"],["干涉儀與去除點校正","Interferometer and spot calibration"],["清洗、驗收與交接","Cleaning, acceptance and handoff"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,3],[2,3],[3,4],[4,2],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"fabrication","labels":["磁流變液與調節迴路","電磁鐵與拋光輪","多軸數控平台","非球面工件","干涉儀與去除點校正"],"labelsEn":["MR fluid and conditioning loop","Electromagnet and polishing wheel","Multi-axis CNC stage","Aspheric workpiece","Interferometer and spot calibration"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"非球面修形練習：直徑 100 mm 的 BK7 非球面，初始面形 60 nm RMS、300 nm PV。去除點以 10 s 靜止得到 0.40 µm 深度，峰值去除率 40 nm/s = 2.4 µm/min，D 形點 10 mm × 4 mm，體積去除率 ≈ 0.4×10×4×2.4×10⁻³ ≈ 0.04 mm³/min。駐留圖需要的平均去除量取 0.25 µm（高點平均 0.20 µm 加 0.05 µm 底層），體積 0.25×10⁻³ mm × 7854 mm² ≈ 1.96 mm³，修形時間 ≈ 1.96/0.04 ≈ 49 min，含 21% 邊緣越程約 59 min。誤差預算：去除率漂移 3% × 250 nm = 7.5 nm、量測 1 nm、對位 20 µm × 0.5 µm/mm = 10 nm 以 RMS 計約 1 nm（斜率只在邊緣大）、中頻紋理 3 nm，殘差 ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS，縮小 7.3 倍。第二次迭代去除深度降到約 30 nm，漂移項 0.9 nm，殘差 ≈ √(0.9² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 3.4 nm RMS。穿透波前貢獻 (1.517 − 1)×3.4 ≈ 1.8 nm ≈ λ/350。數值皆為教學假設，不代表任何機台規格。","textEn":"Aspheric-figuring exercise: a 100 mm BK7 asphere with initial figure 60 nm RMS and 300 nm PV. A 10 s stationary spot is 0.40 µm deep, so the peak rate is 40 nm/s = 2.4 µm/min; the D-shaped spot is 10 mm × 4 mm with a volumetric rate ≈ 0.4×10×4×2.4×10⁻³ ≈ 0.04 mm³/min. The dwell map needs a mean removal of 0.25 µm (0.20 µm mean height of the hills plus a 0.05 µm floor), a volume of 0.25×10⁻³ mm × 7854 mm² ≈ 1.96 mm³, a run time ≈ 1.96/0.04 ≈ 49 min, about 59 min with 21% edge overrun. Error budget: rate drift 3% × 250 nm = 7.5 nm, metrology 1 nm, registration 20 µm × 0.5 µm/mm = 10 nm at the edge but about 1 nm as an area-weighted RMS because slope is large only near the rim, mid-frequency texture 3 nm, residual ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS, a 7.3-fold reduction. In the second iteration the removal depth falls to about 30 nm, the drift term to 0.9 nm, and the residual ≈ √(0.9² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 3.4 nm RMS. The transmitted-wavefront contribution is (1.517 − 1)×3.4 ≈ 1.8 nm ≈ λ/350. All values are teaching assumptions, not any machine's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a411-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「磁流變效應與降伏應力流體帶」與「Preston 去除關係與去除點函數」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Magnetorheological effect and the yield-stress ribbon\" and \"Preston removal relation and the spot function\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a411-v12-01","title":"磁流變效應與降伏應力流體帶：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Magnetorheological effect and the yield-stress ribbon: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「磁流變液帶與電磁鐵」如何決定磁流變光學拋光的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “MR ribbon and electromagnet” determines the key performance of “Magnetorheological optical finishing”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"磁流變液是水基懸浮液，含有直徑約 4 µm 的羰基鐵粒子、拋光用的氧化鈰或奈米鑽石磨料以及穩定劑。無磁場時它是黏度約 0.5 Pa·s 的流體，可被泵送到旋轉輪面；進入電磁鐵上方約 0.2 到 0.4 T 的區域後，鐵粒子沿磁力線成鏈，流體在毫秒內變成具有降伏應力的賓漢塑性體，形成一條硬化的「流體帶」。工件以約 0.5 mm 的深度浸入帶中，磨料被磁場梯度推向帶的表面，材料去除由這個受控的剪切流決定，而不是由硬質拋光工具的壓力決定。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「磁流變液帶與電磁鐵」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An MR fluid is a water-based suspension of roughly 4 µm carbonyl-iron particles, cerium-oxide or nanodiamond polishing abrasive and stabilisers. Without a field it is a liquid of about 0.5 Pa·s that can be pumped onto a rotating wheel; above the electromagnet, in a field of about 0.2 to 0.4 T, the iron particles chain along field lines and within milliseconds the fluid becomes a Bingham plastic with a yield stress, forming a stiffened ribbon. The workpiece is immersed about 0.5 mm into the ribbon, the field gradient pushes abrasive toward the ribbon surface, and removal is governed by this controlled shear flow rather than by the pressure of a hard tool. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “MR ribbon and electromagnet”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：賓漢模型 τ = τ_y(B) + η·γ̇。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Bingham model τ = τ_y(B) + η·γ̇.","failure":"常見誤解：「磁流變拋光就是用磁鐵把磨料壓在工件上，去除量取決於壓力大小。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"MRF simply presses abrasive onto the part with a magnet, so removal depends on how hard it presses.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「磁流變液帶與電磁鐵」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “MR ribbon and electromagnet”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-01-k1","title":"磁流變效應與降伏應力流體帶","titleEn":"Magnetorheological effect and the yield-stress ribbon","text":"磁流變液是水基懸浮液，含有直徑約 4 µm 的羰基鐵粒子、拋光用的氧化鈰或奈米鑽石磨料以及穩定劑。無磁場時它是黏度約 0.5 Pa·s 的流體，可被泵送到旋轉輪面；進入電磁鐵上方約 0.2 到 0.4 T 的區域後，鐵粒子沿磁力線成鏈，流體在毫秒內變成具有降伏應力的賓漢塑性體，形成一條硬化的「流體帶」。","textEn":"An MR fluid is a water-based suspension of roughly 4 µm carbonyl-iron particles, cerium-oxide or nanodiamond polishing abrasive and stabilisers. Without a field it is a liquid of about 0.5 Pa·s that can be pumped onto a rotating wheel; above the electromagnet, in a field of about 0.2 to 0.4 T, the iron particles chain along field lines and within milliseconds the fluid becomes a Bingham plastic with a yield stress, forming a stiffened ribbon.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：磁流變拋光就是用磁鐵把磨料壓在工件上，去除量取決於壓力大小。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: MRF simply presses abrasive onto the part with a magnet, so removal depends on how hard it presses. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「磁流變效應與降伏應力流體帶」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Magnetorheological effect and the yield-stress ribbon\" is correct?","options":["磁流變拋光就是用磁鐵把磨料壓在工件上，去除量取決於壓力大小。","磁流變液是水基懸浮液，含有直徑約 4 µm 的羰基鐵粒子、拋光用的氧化鈰或奈米鑽石磨料以及穩定劑。","去除點只與流體有關，與工件曲率和浸入深度無關。"],"optionsEn":["MRF simply presses abrasive onto the part with a magnet, so removal depends on how hard it presses.","An MR fluid is a water-based suspension of roughly 4 µm carbonyl-iron particles, cerium-oxide or nanodiamond polishing abrasive and stabilisers.","The spot depends only on the fluid, not on part curvature or immersion depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"磁流變液是水基懸浮液，含有直徑約 4 µm 的羰基鐵粒子、拋光用的氧化鈰或奈米鑽石磨料以及穩定劑。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An MR fluid is a water-based suspension of roughly 4 µm carbonyl-iron particles, cerium-oxide or nanodiamond polishing abrasive and stabilisers. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a411-v12-02","title":"磁流變效應與降伏應力流體帶：定量估算","titleEn":"Magnetorheological effect and the yield-stress ribbon: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「磁流變液帶與電磁鐵」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “MR ribbon and electromagnet” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：賓漢模型 τ = τ_y(B) + η·γ̇。取 0.3 T 下 τ_y ≈ 20 kPa（教學假設）、η = 0.5 Pa·s；輪面速度 2 m/s、浸入深度 0.5 mm 的剪切率 γ̇ ≈ 2/(0.5×10⁻³) = 4000 s⁻¹，黏性項 η·γ̇ = 2 kPa，只有降伏項的十分之一，所以去除主要由磁場設定的降伏應力決定，而磁場電流 5% 的變化會直接反映為去除率變化。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Bingham model τ = τ_y(B) + η·γ̇. Take τ_y ≈ 20 kPa at 0.3 T (teaching assumption) and η = 0.5 Pa·s; at a wheel speed of 2 m/s and 0.5 mm immersion the shear rate γ̇ ≈ 2/(0.5×10⁻³) = 4000 s⁻¹, so the viscous term η·γ̇ = 2 kPa is only a tenth of the yield term. Removal is therefore set mainly by the field-controlled yield stress, and a 5% change in magnet current shows up directly as a removal-rate change. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用旋轉流變儀在不同磁場下量流體的降伏應力與黏度曲線，確認 τ_y 隨磁場的上升與飽和；在機台上以高斯計量輪面上方磁通密度，並用特氟龍刮片量流體帶高度，確認帶形與磁場分佈一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the fluid's yield stress and viscosity curves at several fields with a rotational rheometer to confirm how τ_y rises and saturates with field; on the machine, measure flux density above the wheel with a gaussmeter and ribbon height with a PTFE gauge to confirm the ribbon shape matches the field distribution.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"賓漢模型 τ = τ_y(B) + η·γ̇。取 0.3 T 下 τ_y ≈ 20 kPa（教學假設）、η = 0.5 Pa·s；輪面速度 2 m/s、浸入深度 0.5 mm 的剪切率 γ̇ ≈ 2/(0.5×10⁻³) = 4000 s⁻¹，黏性項 η·γ̇ = 2 kPa，只有降伏項的十分之一，所以去除主要由磁場設定的降伏應力決定，而磁場電流 5% 的變化會直接反映為去除率變化。","textEn":"Bingham model τ = τ_y(B) + η·γ̇. Take τ_y ≈ 20 kPa at 0.3 T (teaching assumption) and η = 0.5 Pa·s; at a wheel speed of 2 m/s and 0.5 mm immersion the shear rate γ̇ ≈ 2/(0.5×10⁻³) = 4000 s⁻¹, so the viscous term η·γ̇ = 2 kPa is only a tenth of the yield term. Removal is therefore set mainly by the field-controlled yield stress, and a 5% change in magnet current shows up directly as a removal-rate change.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「磁流變效應與降伏應力流體帶」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Magnetorheological effect and the yield-stress ribbon\", which statement holds?","options":["只要是拋光，就一定會在表面下留下新的損傷層。","只要 RMS 達標，面形圖裡的週期性紋理就不會影響成像。","賓漢模型 τ = τ_y(B) + η·γ̇。"],"optionsEn":["Any polishing process necessarily leaves a fresh damage layer beneath the surface.","If the RMS meets specification, periodic texture in the map cannot affect imaging.","Bingham model τ = τ_y(B) + η·γ̇."],"answer":2,"explanation":"賓漢模型 τ = τ_y(B) + η·γ̇。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Bingham model τ = τ_y(B) + η·γ̇. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a411-v12-03","title":"磁流變效應與降伏應力流體帶：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Magnetorheological effect and the yield-stress ribbon: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「磁流變液帶與電磁鐵」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “MR ribbon and electromagnet” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用旋轉流變儀在不同磁場下量流體的降伏應力與黏度曲線，確認 τ_y 隨磁場的上升與飽和；在機台上以高斯計量輪面上方磁通密度，並用特氟龍刮片量流體帶高度，確認帶形與磁場分佈一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the fluid's yield stress and viscosity curves at several fields with a rotational rheometer to confirm how τ_y rises and saturates with field; on the machine, measure flux density above the wheel with a gaussmeter and ribbon height with a PTFE gauge to confirm the ribbon shape matches the field distribution. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：鐵粒子氧化或流體含水量變化會讓降伏應力與黏度漂移，去除點深度在一天內變化超過 10%，用舊校正值執行的駐留圖留下與誤差圖同形的殘差。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Oxidised iron particles or a change in water content shift yield stress and viscosity, the spot depth drifts by more than 10% within a day, and a dwell map run with the old calibration leaves a residual shaped like the error map.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用旋轉流變儀在不同磁場下量流體的降伏應力與黏度曲線，確認 τ_y 隨磁場的上升與飽和；在機台上以高斯計量輪面上方磁通密度，並用特氟龍刮片量流體帶高度，確認帶形與磁場分佈一致。","textEn":"Measure the fluid's yield stress and viscosity curves at several fields with a rotational rheometer to confirm how τ_y rises and saturates with field; on the machine, measure flux density above the wheel with a gaussmeter and ribbon height with a PTFE gauge to confirm the ribbon shape matches the field distribution.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「磁流變效應與降伏應力流體帶」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Magnetorheological effect and the yield-stress ribbon\"?","options":["用旋轉流變儀在不同磁場下量流體的降伏應力與黏度曲線，確認 τ_y 隨磁場的上升與飽和。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","磁流變拋光可以取代所有前段工序，直接從粗磨面修到最終面形。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the fluid's yield stress and viscosity curves at several fields with a rotational rheometer to confirm how τ_y rises and saturates with field.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","MRF can replace all earlier steps and figure a rough-ground surface directly to final shape."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用旋轉流變儀在不同磁場下量流體的降伏應力與黏度曲線，確認 τ_y 隨磁場的上升與飽和；在機台上以高斯計量輪面上方磁通密度，並用特氟龍刮片量流體帶高度，確認帶形與磁場分佈一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the fluid's yield stress and viscosity curves at several fields with a rotational rheometer to confirm how τ_y rises and saturates with field; on the machine, measure flux density above the wheel with a gaussmeter and ribbon height with a PTFE gauge to confirm the ribbon shape matches the field distribution. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a411-v12-04","title":"磁流變效應與降伏應力流體帶：失效診斷","titleEn":"Magnetorheological effect and the yield-stress ribbon: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「磁流變液帶與電磁鐵」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “MR ribbon and electromagnet” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"鐵粒子氧化或流體含水量變化會讓降伏應力與黏度漂移，去除點深度在一天內變化超過 10%，用舊校正值執行的駐留圖留下與誤差圖同形的殘差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Oxidised iron particles or a change in water content shift yield stress and viscosity, the spot depth drifts by more than 10% within a day, and a dwell map run with the old calibration leaves a residual shaped like the error map. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：工件以約 0.5 mm 的深度浸入帶中，磨料被磁場梯度推向帶的表面，材料去除由這個受控的剪切流決定，而不是由硬質拋光工具的壓力決定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The workpiece is immersed about 0.5 mm into the ribbon, the field gradient pushes abrasive toward the ribbon surface, and removal is governed by this controlled shear flow rather than by the pressure of a hard tool.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「磁流變拋光就是用磁鐵把磨料壓在工件上，去除量取決於壓力大小。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"MRF simply presses abrasive onto the part with a magnet, so removal depends on how hard it presses.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"鐵粒子氧化或流體含水量變化會讓降伏應力與黏度漂移，去除點深度在一天內變化超過 10%，用舊校正值執行的駐留圖留下與誤差圖同形的殘差。","textEn":"Oxidised iron particles or a change in water content shift yield stress and viscosity, the spot depth drifts by more than 10% within a day, and a dwell map run with the old calibration leaves a residual shaped like the error map.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「磁流變效應與降伏應力流體帶」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Magnetorheological effect and the yield-stress ribbon\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","鐵粒子氧化或流體含水量變化會讓降伏應力與黏度漂移，去除點深度在一天內變化超過 10%，用舊校正值執行的駐留圖留下與誤差圖同形的殘差。","去除點只與流體有關，與工件曲率和浸入深度無關。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Oxidised iron particles or a change in water content shift yield stress and viscosity, the spot depth drifts by more than 10% within a day, and a dwell map run with the old calibration leaves a residual shaped like the error map.","The spot depends only on the fluid, not on part curvature or immersion depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"鐵粒子氧化或流體含水量變化會讓降伏應力與黏度漂移，去除點深度在一天內變化超過 10%，用舊校正值執行的駐留圖留下與誤差圖同形的殘差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Oxidised iron particles or a change in water content shift yield stress and viscosity, the spot depth drifts by more than 10% within a day, and a dwell map run with the old calibration leaves a residual shaped like the error map. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a411-v12-05","title":"Preston 去除關係與去除點函數：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Preston removal relation and the spot function: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「D 形去除點與 Preston 關係」如何決定磁流變光學拋光的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “D-shaped removal spot and the Preston relation” determines the key performance of “Magnetorheological optical finishing”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"材料去除率遵循 Preston 關係：單位時間去除深度正比於介面應力與相對速度的乘積，比例常數 k_p 由材料、磨料與化學環境決定。工件靜止在流體帶中時，去除集中在一個 D 形的去除點，長軸沿輪面運動方向約 10 mm、寬約 4 mm，深度分佈由帶內剪切應力與磨料分佈決定。去除點是整個修形的單位脈衝：工件沿螺旋或光柵軌跡移動，實際去除等於去除點函數與駐留時間的卷積，去除點一旦量準，修形便是確定性的。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「D 形去除點與 Preston 關係」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Removal follows the Preston relation: depth removed per unit time is proportional to the product of interfacial stress and relative velocity, with a constant k_p set by material, abrasive and chemistry. With the part held still in the ribbon the removal concentrates in a D-shaped spot about 10 mm long along the wheel motion and 4 mm wide, its depth profile set by the shear stress and abrasive distribution in the ribbon. The spot is the unit impulse of the whole process: the part moves along a spiral or raster path, actual removal equals the convolution of the spot function with dwell time, and once the spot is measured the figuring is deterministic. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “D-shaped removal spot and the Preston relation”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：dz/dt = k_p·P·v。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: dz/dt = k_p·P·v.","failure":"常見誤解：「去除點只與流體有關，與工件曲率和浸入深度無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The spot depends only on the fluid, not on part curvature or immersion depth.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「D 形去除點與 Preston 關係」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “D-shaped removal spot and the Preston relation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-05-k1","title":"Preston 去除關係與去除點函數","titleEn":"Preston removal relation and the spot function","text":"材料去除率遵循 Preston 關係：單位時間去除深度正比於介面應力與相對速度的乘積，比例常數 k_p 由材料、磨料與化學環境決定。工件靜止在流體帶中時，去除集中在一個 D 形的去除點，長軸沿輪面運動方向約 10 mm、寬約 4 mm，深度分佈由帶內剪切應力與磨料分佈決定。","textEn":"Removal follows the Preston relation: depth removed per unit time is proportional to the product of interfacial stress and relative velocity, with a constant k_p set by material, abrasive and chemistry. With the part held still in the ribbon the removal concentrates in a D-shaped spot about 10 mm long along the wheel motion and 4 mm wide, its depth profile set by the shear stress and abrasive distribution in the ribbon.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：去除點只與流體有關，與工件曲率和浸入深度無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The spot depends only on the fluid, not on part curvature or immersion depth. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「Preston 去除關係與去除點函數」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Preston removal relation and the spot function\" is correct?","options":["去除點只與流體有關，與工件曲率和浸入深度無關。","磁流變液像拋光粉一樣，配好以後就可以長期使用不必監控。","材料去除率遵循 Preston 關係：單位時間去除深度正比於介面應力與相對速度的乘積，比例常數 k_p 由材料、磨料與化學環境決定。"],"optionsEn":["The spot depends only on the fluid, not on part curvature or immersion depth.","MR fluid is like polishing slurry: once mixed it can be used for a long time without monitoring.","Removal follows the Preston relation: depth removed per unit time is proportional to the product of interfacial stress and relative velocity, with a constant k_p set by material, abrasive and chemistry."],"answer":2,"explanation":"材料去除率遵循 Preston 關係：單位時間去除深度正比於介面應力與相對速度的乘積，比例常數 k_p 由材料、磨料與化學環境決定。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Removal follows the Preston relation: depth removed per unit time is proportional to the product of interfacial stress and relative velocity, with a constant k_p set by material, abrasive and chemistry. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a411-v12-06","title":"Preston 去除關係與去除點函數：定量估算","titleEn":"Preston removal relation and the spot function: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「D 形去除點與 Preston 關係」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “D-shaped removal spot and the Preston relation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：dz/dt = k_p·P·v。取 BK7 配氧化鈰的 k_p = 2×10⁻¹³ Pa⁻¹、介面應力 P = 100 kPa、v = 2 m/s（教學假設），峰值去除率 = 2×10⁻¹³ × 10⁵ × 2 = 4×10⁻⁸ m/s = 40 nm/s ≈ 2.4 µm/min；靜止 10 s 得到 0.4 µm 深的去除點。D 形去除點體積去除率 ≈ 0.4 × 10 mm × 4 mm × 2.4 µm/min ≈ 0.04 mm³/min。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: dz/dt = k_p·P·v. With k_p = 2×10⁻¹³ Pa⁻¹ for BK7 with cerium oxide, interfacial stress P = 100 kPa and v = 2 m/s (teaching assumptions), the peak removal rate = 2×10⁻¹³ × 10⁵ × 2 = 4×10⁻⁸ m/s = 40 nm/s ≈ 2.4 µm/min, so a 10 s stationary dwell makes a 0.4 µm deep spot. The D-shaped spot's volumetric rate ≈ 0.4 × 10 mm × 4 mm × 2.4 µm/min ≈ 0.04 mm³/min. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在同材料、同曲率的試片上打幾個固定時間的去除點，用干涉儀量深度與形狀，深度除以時間得到峰值去除率，積分得到體積去除率；改變輪速 ±20% 重做，確認去除率近似線性隨速度變化，符合 Preston 關係。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Make several fixed-time spots on a witness piece of the same material and curvature, measure depth and shape with an interferometer, divide depth by time for the peak rate and integrate for the volumetric rate; repeat at wheel speeds ±20% to confirm the rate scales roughly linearly with speed as the Preston relation predicts.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"dz/dt = k_p·P·v。取 BK7 配氧化鈰的 k_p = 2×10⁻¹³ Pa⁻¹、介面應力 P = 100 kPa、v = 2 m/s（教學假設），峰值去除率 = 2×10⁻¹³ × 10⁵ × 2 = 4×10⁻⁸ m/s = 40 nm/s ≈ 2.4 µm/min；靜止 10 s 得到 0.4 µm 深的去除點。D 形去除點體積去除率 ≈ 0.4 × 10 mm × 4 mm × 2.4 µm/min ≈ 0.04 mm³/min。","textEn":"dz/dt = k_p·P·v. With k_p = 2×10⁻¹³ Pa⁻¹ for BK7 with cerium oxide, interfacial stress P = 100 kPa and v = 2 m/s (teaching assumptions), the peak removal rate = 2×10⁻¹³ × 10⁵ × 2 = 4×10⁻⁸ m/s = 40 nm/s ≈ 2.4 µm/min, so a 10 s stationary dwell makes a 0.4 µm deep spot. The D-shaped spot's volumetric rate ≈ 0.4 × 10 mm × 4 mm × 2.4 µm/min ≈ 0.04 mm³/min.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「Preston 去除關係與去除點函數」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Preston removal relation and the spot function\", which statement holds?","options":["dz/dt = k_p·P·v。","量測圖只要夠清晰就能直接送進駐留時間計算，對位和校正是可選步驟。","磁流變拋光可以取代所有前段工序，直接從粗磨面修到最終面形。"],"optionsEn":["dz/dt = k_p·P·v.","A sharp measurement map can go straight into dwell-time calculation; registration and calibration are optional.","MRF can replace all earlier steps and figure a rough-ground surface directly to final shape."],"answer":0,"explanation":"dz/dt = k_p·P·v。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"dz/dt = k_p·P·v. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a411-v12-07","title":"Preston 去除關係與去除點函數：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Preston removal relation and the spot function: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「D 形去除點與 Preston 關係」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “D-shaped removal spot and the Preston relation” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在同材料、同曲率的試片上打幾個固定時間的去除點，用干涉儀量深度與形狀，深度除以時間得到峰值去除率，積分得到體積去除率；改變輪速 ±20% 重做，確認去除率近似線性隨速度變化，符合 Preston 關係。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Make several fixed-time spots on a witness piece of the same material and curvature, measure depth and shape with an interferometer, divide depth by time for the peak rate and integrate for the volumetric rate; repeat at wheel speeds ±20% to confirm the rate scales roughly linearly with speed as the Preston relation predicts. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：在平面試片上校正去除點，卻拿來修曲率半徑 100 mm 的凸面，浸入幾何改變使去除點變形，實際去除比預測偏 10% 以上，面形收斂停在幾十奈米。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Calibrating the spot on a flat witness and using it on a convex surface of 100 mm radius changes the immersion geometry, distorts the spot, and shifts removal by more than 10% from prediction, stalling figure convergence at tens of nanometres.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在同材料、同曲率的試片上打幾個固定時間的去除點，用干涉儀量深度與形狀，深度除以時間得到峰值去除率，積分得到體積去除率；改變輪速 ±20% 重做，確認去除率近似線性隨速度變化，符合 Preston 關係。","textEn":"Make several fixed-time spots on a witness piece of the same material and curvature, measure depth and shape with an interferometer, divide depth by time for the peak rate and integrate for the volumetric rate; repeat at wheel speeds ±20% to confirm the rate scales roughly linearly with speed as the Preston relation predicts.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「Preston 去除關係與去除點函數」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Preston removal relation and the spot function\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在同材料、同曲率的試片上打幾個固定時間的去除點，用干涉儀量深度與形狀，深度除以時間得到峰值去除率，積分得到體積去除率。","表面誤差數值就是波前誤差，透鏡與反射鏡的規格可以直接互換。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Make several fixed-time spots on a witness piece of the same material and curvature, measure depth and shape with an interferometer, divide depth by time for the peak rate and integrate for the volumetric rate.","Surface error equals wavefront error, so lens and mirror specifications are interchangeable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在同材料、同曲率的試片上打幾個固定時間的去除點，用干涉儀量深度與形狀，深度除以時間得到峰值去除率，積分得到體積去除率；改變輪速 ±20% 重做，確認去除率近似線性隨速度變化，符合 Preston 關係。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Make several fixed-time spots on a witness piece of the same material and curvature, measure depth and shape with an interferometer, divide depth by time for the peak rate and integrate for the volumetric rate; repeat at wheel speeds ±20% to confirm the rate scales roughly linearly with speed as the Preston relation predicts. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a411-v12-08","title":"Preston 去除關係與去除點函數：失效診斷","titleEn":"Preston removal relation and the spot function: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「D 形去除點與 Preston 關係」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “D-shaped removal spot and the Preston relation” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"在平面試片上校正去除點，卻拿來修曲率半徑 100 mm 的凸面，浸入幾何改變使去除點變形，實際去除比預測偏 10% 以上，面形收斂停在幾十奈米。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Calibrating the spot on a flat witness and using it on a convex surface of 100 mm radius changes the immersion geometry, distorts the spot, and shifts removal by more than 10% from prediction, stalling figure convergence at tens of nanometres. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：去除點是整個修形的單位脈衝：工件沿螺旋或光柵軌跡移動，實際去除等於去除點函數與駐留時間的卷積，去除點一旦量準，修形便是確定性的。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The spot is the unit impulse of the whole process: the part moves along a spiral or raster path, actual removal equals the convolution of the spot function with dwell time, and once the spot is measured the figuring is deterministic.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「去除點只與流體有關，與工件曲率和浸入深度無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The spot depends only on the fluid, not on part curvature or immersion depth.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"在平面試片上校正去除點，卻拿來修曲率半徑 100 mm 的凸面，浸入幾何改變使去除點變形，實際去除比預測偏 10% 以上，面形收斂停在幾十奈米。","textEn":"Calibrating the spot on a flat witness and using it on a convex surface of 100 mm radius changes the immersion geometry, distorts the spot, and shifts removal by more than 10% from prediction, stalling figure convergence at tens of nanometres.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「Preston 去除關係與去除點函數」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Preston removal relation and the spot function\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","磁流變液像拋光粉一樣，配好以後就可以長期使用不必監控。","在平面試片上校正去除點，卻拿來修曲率半徑 100 mm 的凸面，浸入幾何改變使去除點變形，實際去除比預測偏 10% 以上，面形收斂停在幾十奈米。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","MR fluid is like polishing slurry: once mixed it can be used for a long time without monitoring.","Calibrating the spot on a flat witness and using it on a convex surface of 100 mm radius changes the immersion geometry, distorts the spot, and shifts removal by more than 10% from prediction, stalling figure convergence at tens of nanometres."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在平面試片上校正去除點，卻拿來修曲率半徑 100 mm 的凸面，浸入幾何改變使去除點變形，實際去除比預測偏 10% 以上，面形收斂停在幾十奈米。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Calibrating the spot on a flat witness and using it on a convex surface of 100 mm radius changes the immersion geometry, distorts the spot, and shifts removal by more than 10% from prediction, stalling figure convergence at tens of nanometres. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a411-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「機台結構、流體循環與黏度閉迴路」與「材料反應、磨料選擇與次表面損傷」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Machine structure, fluid circulation and the viscosity loop\" and \"Material response, abrasive choice and subsurface damage\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a411-v12-09","title":"機台結構、流體循環與黏度閉迴路：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Machine structure, fluid circulation and the viscosity loop: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「拋光輪、噴嘴與流體調節迴路」如何決定磁流變光學拋光的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Wheel, nozzle and fluid-conditioning loop” determines the key performance of “Magnetorheological optical finishing”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"機台把流體從調節槽泵到噴嘴，鋪在直徑約 150 mm 的旋轉輪面上，流過電磁鐵極靴上方的工作區後被刮刀回收，回到調節槽重新混合與控溫。因為水會蒸發、鐵粒子會氧化，調節迴路用流量與壓降推算黏度，並自動補水把黏度維持在設定值，這是去除率穩定的關鍵。工件由多軸數控平台握持，三軸機可修平面與淺曲面，修非球面與自由曲面需五軸讓表面法線始終對準流體帶。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「拋光輪、噴嘴與流體調節迴路」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The machine pumps fluid from a conditioning tank to a nozzle, lays it on a rotating wheel of about 150 mm diameter, carries it through the working zone above the electromagnet pole pieces, scrapes it off and returns it to the tank for remixing and temperature control. Because water evaporates and iron oxidises, the loop infers viscosity from flow and pressure drop and adds water automatically to hold the setpoint, which is the key to a stable removal rate. A multi-axis CNC stage holds the part; three axes suffice for flats and shallow curves, while aspheres and freeforms need five axes to keep the surface normal aligned to the ribbon. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Wheel, nozzle and fluid-conditioning loop”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：輪面速度 v = πDN/60：D = 150 mm、N = 250 rpm 時 v = π×0.15×250/60 ≈ 1.96 m/s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Wheel speed v = πDN/60: for D = 150 mm and N = 250 rpm, v = π×0.15×250/60 ≈ 1.96 m/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「磁流變液像拋光粉一樣，配好以後就可以長期使用不必監控。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"MR fluid is like polishing slurry: once mixed it can be used for a long time without monitoring.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「拋光輪、噴嘴與流體調節迴路」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Wheel, nozzle and fluid-conditioning loop”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-09-k1","title":"機台結構、流體循環與黏度閉迴路","titleEn":"Machine structure, fluid circulation and the viscosity loop","text":"機台把流體從調節槽泵到噴嘴，鋪在直徑約 150 mm 的旋轉輪面上，流過電磁鐵極靴上方的工作區後被刮刀回收，回到調節槽重新混合與控溫。因為水會蒸發、鐵粒子會氧化，調節迴路用流量與壓降推算黏度，並自動補水把黏度維持在設定值，這是去除率穩定的關鍵。","textEn":"The machine pumps fluid from a conditioning tank to a nozzle, lays it on a rotating wheel of about 150 mm diameter, carries it through the working zone above the electromagnet pole pieces, scrapes it off and returns it to the tank for remixing and temperature control. Because water evaporates and iron oxidises, the loop infers viscosity from flow and pressure drop and adds water automatically to hold the setpoint, which is the key to a stable removal rate.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：磁流變液像拋光粉一樣，配好以後就可以長期使用不必監控。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: MR fluid is like polishing slurry: once mixed it can be used for a long time without monitoring. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「機台結構、流體循環與黏度閉迴路」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Machine structure, fluid circulation and the viscosity loop\" is correct?","options":["機台把流體從調節槽泵到噴嘴，鋪在直徑約 150 mm 的旋轉輪面上，流過電磁鐵極靴上方的工作區後被刮刀回收，回到調節槽重新混合與控溫。","磁流變液像拋光粉一樣，配好以後就可以長期使用不必監控。","只要是拋光，就一定會在表面下留下新的損傷層。"],"optionsEn":["The machine pumps fluid from a conditioning tank to a nozzle, lays it on a rotating wheel of about 150 mm diameter, carries it through the working zone above the electromagnet pole pieces, scrapes it off and returns it to the tank for remixing and temperature control.","MR fluid is like polishing slurry: once mixed it can be used for a long time without monitoring.","Any polishing process necessarily leaves a fresh damage layer beneath the surface."],"answer":0,"explanation":"機台把流體從調節槽泵到噴嘴，鋪在直徑約 150 mm 的旋轉輪面上，流過電磁鐵極靴上方的工作區後被刮刀回收，回到調節槽重新混合與控溫。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The machine pumps fluid from a conditioning tank to a nozzle, lays it on a rotating wheel of about 150 mm diameter, carries it through the working zone above the electromagnet pole pieces, scrapes it off and returns it to the tank for remixing and temperature control. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a411-v12-10","title":"機台結構、流體循環與黏度閉迴路：定量估算","titleEn":"Machine structure, fluid circulation and the viscosity loop: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「拋光輪、噴嘴與流體調節迴路」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Wheel, nozzle and fluid-conditioning loop” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：輪面速度 v = πDN/60：D = 150 mm、N = 250 rpm 時 v = π×0.15×250/60 ≈ 1.96 m/s。流體帶高度 1.5 mm、浸入 0.5 mm；若流體含水量下降 1%，黏度上升約 5%（教學假設），依 Preston 關係去除率同向變化數個百分點，所以黏度迴路的控制精度要求為 ±1%。總量 2 L、流量 1 L/min 的迴路在一小時內讓每一份流體經過工作區約 30 次。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Wheel speed v = πDN/60: for D = 150 mm and N = 250 rpm, v = π×0.15×250/60 ≈ 1.96 m/s. Ribbon height 1.5 mm with 0.5 mm immersion; if the water content drops 1% the viscosity rises about 5% (teaching assumption) and the Preston removal rate shifts by several percent, so the viscosity loop must hold ±1%. With a 2 L charge circulating at 1 L/min, each portion of fluid passes the working zone about 30 times per hour. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以流變儀每日取樣比對機台推算的黏度，確認兩者差異在 ±2% 內；用轉速計與高斯計檢查輪速與磁場，並用去除點深度的日誌追蹤去除率與黏度、溫度的相關性，建立機台的穩定度紀錄。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare a daily rheometer sample with the machine's inferred viscosity to confirm agreement within ±2%; check wheel speed and field with a tachometer and gaussmeter, and log spot depth against viscosity and temperature to build a stability record for the machine.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"輪面速度 v = πDN/60：D = 150 mm、N = 250 rpm 時 v = π×0.15×250/60 ≈ 1.96 m/s。流體帶高度 1.5 mm、浸入 0.5 mm；若流體含水量下降 1%，黏度上升約 5%（教學假設），依 Preston 關係去除率同向變化數個百分點，所以黏度迴路的控制精度要求為 ±1%。總量 2 L、流量 1 L/min 的迴路在一小時內讓每一份流體經過工作區約 30 次。","textEn":"Wheel speed v = πDN/60: for D = 150 mm and N = 250 rpm, v = π×0.15×250/60 ≈ 1.96 m/s. Ribbon height 1.5 mm with 0.5 mm immersion; if the water content drops 1% the viscosity rises about 5% (teaching assumption) and the Preston removal rate shifts by several percent, so the viscosity loop must hold ±1%. With a 2 L charge circulating at 1 L/min, each portion of fluid passes the working zone about 30 times per hour.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「機台結構、流體循環與黏度閉迴路」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Machine structure, fluid circulation and the viscosity loop\", which statement holds?","options":["只要 RMS 達標，面形圖裡的週期性紋理就不會影響成像。","輪面速度 v = πDN/60：D = 150 mm、N = 250 rpm 時 v = π×0.15×250/60 ≈ 1.96 m/s。","表面誤差數值就是波前誤差，透鏡與反射鏡的規格可以直接互換。"],"optionsEn":["If the RMS meets specification, periodic texture in the map cannot affect imaging.","Wheel speed v = πDN/60: for D = 150 mm and N = 250 rpm, v = π×0.15×250/60 ≈ 1.96 m/s.","Surface error equals wavefront error, so lens and mirror specifications are interchangeable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"輪面速度 v = πDN/60：D = 150 mm、N = 250 rpm 時 v = π×0.15×250/60 ≈ 1.96 m/s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Wheel speed v = πDN/60: for D = 150 mm and N = 250 rpm, v = π×0.15×250/60 ≈ 1.96 m/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a411-v12-11","title":"機台結構、流體循環與黏度閉迴路：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Machine structure, fluid circulation and the viscosity loop: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「拋光輪、噴嘴與流體調節迴路」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Wheel, nozzle and fluid-conditioning loop” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以流變儀每日取樣比對機台推算的黏度，確認兩者差異在 ±2% 內；用轉速計與高斯計檢查輪速與磁場，並用去除點深度的日誌追蹤去除率與黏度、溫度的相關性，建立機台的穩定度紀錄。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare a daily rheometer sample with the machine's inferred viscosity to confirm agreement within ±2%; check wheel speed and field with a tachometer and gaussmeter, and log spot depth against viscosity and temperature to build a stability record for the machine. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：黏度感測器被乾涸的流體結塊堵塞後，補水邏輯失準，流體越來越濃，去除點深度在一次長時間修形中慢慢下降，面形出現沿軌跡遞減的系統性殘差。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A viscosity sensor clogged by dried fluid lumps misleads the water-addition logic, the fluid thickens, the spot depth falls slowly during a long run, and the figure carries a systematic residual that decreases along the tool path.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以流變儀每日取樣比對機台推算的黏度，確認兩者差異在 ±2% 內；用轉速計與高斯計檢查輪速與磁場，並用去除點深度的日誌追蹤去除率與黏度、溫度的相關性，建立機台的穩定度紀錄。","textEn":"Compare a daily rheometer sample with the machine's inferred viscosity to confirm agreement within ±2%; check wheel speed and field with a tachometer and gaussmeter, and log spot depth against viscosity and temperature to build a stability record for the machine.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「機台結構、流體循環與黏度閉迴路」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Machine structure, fluid circulation and the viscosity loop\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","磁流變拋光就是用磁鐵把磨料壓在工件上，去除量取決於壓力大小。","以流變儀每日取樣比對機台推算的黏度，確認兩者差異在 ±2% 內。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","MRF simply presses abrasive onto the part with a magnet, so removal depends on how hard it presses.","Compare a daily rheometer sample with the machine's inferred viscosity to confirm agreement within ±2%."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以流變儀每日取樣比對機台推算的黏度，確認兩者差異在 ±2% 內；用轉速計與高斯計檢查輪速與磁場，並用去除點深度的日誌追蹤去除率與黏度、溫度的相關性，建立機台的穩定度紀錄。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare a daily rheometer sample with the machine's inferred viscosity to confirm agreement within ±2%; check wheel speed and field with a tachometer and gaussmeter, and log spot depth against viscosity and temperature to build a stability record for the machine. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a411-v12-12","title":"機台結構、流體循環與黏度閉迴路：失效診斷","titleEn":"Machine structure, fluid circulation and the viscosity loop: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「拋光輪、噴嘴與流體調節迴路」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Wheel, nozzle and fluid-conditioning loop” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"黏度感測器被乾涸的流體結塊堵塞後，補水邏輯失準，流體越來越濃，去除點深度在一次長時間修形中慢慢下降，面形出現沿軌跡遞減的系統性殘差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A viscosity sensor clogged by dried fluid lumps misleads the water-addition logic, the fluid thickens, the spot depth falls slowly during a long run, and the figure carries a systematic residual that decreases along the tool path. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：工件由多軸數控平台握持，三軸機可修平面與淺曲面，修非球面與自由曲面需五軸讓表面法線始終對準流體帶。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A multi-axis CNC stage holds the part; three axes suffice for flats and shallow curves, while aspheres and freeforms need five axes to keep the surface normal aligned to the ribbon.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「磁流變液像拋光粉一樣，配好以後就可以長期使用不必監控。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"MR fluid is like polishing slurry: once mixed it can be used for a long time without monitoring.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"黏度感測器被乾涸的流體結塊堵塞後，補水邏輯失準，流體越來越濃，去除點深度在一次長時間修形中慢慢下降，面形出現沿軌跡遞減的系統性殘差。","textEn":"A viscosity sensor clogged by dried fluid lumps misleads the water-addition logic, the fluid thickens, the spot depth falls slowly during a long run, and the figure carries a systematic residual that decreases along the tool path.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「機台結構、流體循環與黏度閉迴路」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Machine structure, fluid circulation and the viscosity loop\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["黏度感測器被乾涸的流體結塊堵塞後，補水邏輯失準，流體越來越濃，去除點深度在一次長時間修形中慢慢下降，面形出現沿軌跡遞減的系統性殘差。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要是拋光，就一定會在表面下留下新的損傷層。"],"optionsEn":["A viscosity sensor clogged by dried fluid lumps misleads the water-addition logic, the fluid thickens, the spot depth falls slowly during a long run, and the figure carries a systematic residual that decreases along the tool path.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Any polishing process necessarily leaves a fresh damage layer beneath the surface."],"answer":0,"explanation":"黏度感測器被乾涸的流體結塊堵塞後，補水邏輯失準，流體越來越濃，去除點深度在一次長時間修形中慢慢下降，面形出現沿軌跡遞減的系統性殘差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A viscosity sensor clogged by dried fluid lumps misleads the water-addition logic, the fluid thickens, the spot depth falls slowly during a long run, and the figure carries a systematic residual that decreases along the tool path. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a411-v12-13","title":"材料反應、磨料選擇與次表面損傷：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Material response, abrasive choice and subsurface damage: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「工件材料與次表面損傷層」如何決定磁流變光學拋光的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Workpiece material and subsurface-damage layer” determines the key performance of “Magnetorheological optical finishing”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"不同材料的 Preston 常數差異很大：矽酸鹽玻璃配氧化鈰去除快，熔融石英較慢，藍寶石與碳化矽需要奈米鑽石磨料且去除率低一個數量級。磁流變拋光的法向載荷小、以剪切為主，因此不會產生新的次表面損傷，反而能去除前段研磨與拋光留下的微裂紋層，表面粗糙度可達 0.5 到 1 nm RMS。對軟質或水溶性晶體，流體的水基環境與化學作用必須另外評估，否則會出現腐蝕紋或霧化。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「工件材料與次表面損傷層」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Preston constants differ widely between materials: silicate glass with cerium oxide removes quickly, fused silica more slowly, and sapphire or silicon carbide need nanodiamond abrasive with rates an order of magnitude lower. Because MRF applies a small normal load and works by shear, it creates no new subsurface damage and instead strips the microcrack layer left by earlier grinding and polishing, reaching 0.5 to 1 nm RMS roughness. For soft or water-soluble crystals the aqueous chemistry of the fluid must be assessed separately or etch texture and haze appear. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Workpiece material and subsurface-damage layer”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：取教學假設的峰值去除率：BK7 2.4 µm/min、熔融石英 1.2 µm/min、藍寶石（鑽石磨料）0.2 µm/min。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Take teaching-assumption peak rates of 2.4 µm/min for BK7, 1.2 µm/min for fused silica and 0.2 µm/min for sapphire with diamond.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要是拋光，就一定會在表面下留下新的損傷層。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Any polishing process necessarily leaves a fresh damage layer beneath the surface.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「工件材料與次表面損傷層」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Workpiece material and subsurface-damage layer”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-13-k1","title":"材料反應、磨料選擇與次表面損傷","titleEn":"Material response, abrasive choice and subsurface damage","text":"不同材料的 Preston 常數差異很大：矽酸鹽玻璃配氧化鈰去除快，熔融石英較慢，藍寶石與碳化矽需要奈米鑽石磨料且去除率低一個數量級。磁流變拋光的法向載荷小、以剪切為主，因此不會產生新的次表面損傷，反而能去除前段研磨與拋光留下的微裂紋層，表面粗糙度可達 0.5 到 1 nm RMS。","textEn":"Preston constants differ widely between materials: silicate glass with cerium oxide removes quickly, fused silica more slowly, and sapphire or silicon carbide need nanodiamond abrasive with rates an order of magnitude lower. Because MRF applies a small normal load and works by shear, it creates no new subsurface damage and instead strips the microcrack layer left by earlier grinding and polishing, reaching 0.5 to 1 nm RMS roughness.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要是拋光，就一定會在表面下留下新的損傷層。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Any polishing process necessarily leaves a fresh damage layer beneath the surface. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「材料反應、磨料選擇與次表面損傷」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Material response, abrasive choice and subsurface damage\" is correct?","options":["只要是拋光，就一定會在表面下留下新的損傷層。","不同材料的 Preston 常數差異很大：矽酸鹽玻璃配氧化鈰去除快，熔融石英較慢，藍寶石與碳化矽需要奈米鑽石磨料且去除率低一個數量級。","量測圖只要夠清晰就能直接送進駐留時間計算，對位和校正是可選步驟。"],"optionsEn":["Any polishing process necessarily leaves a fresh damage layer beneath the surface.","Preston constants differ widely between materials: silicate glass with cerium oxide removes quickly, fused silica more slowly, and sapphire or silicon carbide need nanodiamond abrasive with rates an order of magnitude lower.","A sharp measurement map can go straight into dwell-time calculation; registration and calibration are optional."],"answer":1,"explanation":"不同材料的 Preston 常數差異很大：矽酸鹽玻璃配氧化鈰去除快，熔融石英較慢，藍寶石與碳化矽需要奈米鑽石磨料且去除率低一個數量級。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Preston constants differ widely between materials: silicate glass with cerium oxide removes quickly, fused silica more slowly, and sapphire or silicon carbide need nanodiamond abrasive with rates an order of magnitude lower. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a411-v12-14","title":"材料反應、磨料選擇與次表面損傷：定量估算","titleEn":"Material response, abrasive choice and subsurface damage: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「工件材料與次表面損傷層」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Workpiece material and subsurface-damage layer” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：取教學假設的峰值去除率：BK7 2.4 µm/min、熔融石英 1.2 µm/min、藍寶石（鑽石磨料）0.2 µm/min。若前段拋光留下 1 µm 的次表面損傷層，在直徑 100 mm 工件上均勻去除 1 µm 需體積 7.85 mm³，以 BK7 的體積去除率 0.04 mm³/min 需約 196 min，藍寶石則需約 12 倍時間，所以硬材料必須在研磨階段就把損傷層壓到更薄。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Take teaching-assumption peak rates of 2.4 µm/min for BK7, 1.2 µm/min for fused silica and 0.2 µm/min for sapphire with diamond. If the previous polish left a 1 µm subsurface-damage layer, removing 1 µm uniformly from a 100 mm part means 7.85 mm³, about 196 min at the BK7 volumetric rate of 0.04 mm³/min and roughly 12 times longer for sapphire, so hard materials must leave the grinding stage with a thinner damage layer. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以磁流變點蝕法逐步加深去除點，用顯微鏡觀察點底部微裂紋消失的深度，直接量出次表面損傷層厚度；修形後以白光干涉儀量粗糙度與 PSD，與修形前比較，確認高頻段下降而非上升。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use the MRF spot-etch method, deepening a spot in steps and observing under a microscope the depth at which microcracks vanish, to measure the subsurface-damage thickness directly; after figuring, measure roughness and PSD with white-light interferometry and compare with the pre-run state to confirm the high-frequency band fell rather than rose.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"取教學假設的峰值去除率：BK7 2.4 µm/min、熔融石英 1.2 µm/min、藍寶石（鑽石磨料）0.2 µm/min。若前段拋光留下 1 µm 的次表面損傷層，在直徑 100 mm 工件上均勻去除 1 µm 需體積 7.85 mm³，以 BK7 的體積去除率 0.04 mm³/min 需約 196 min，藍寶石則需約 12 倍時間，所以硬材料必須在研磨階段就把損傷層壓到更薄。","textEn":"Take teaching-assumption peak rates of 2.4 µm/min for BK7, 1.2 µm/min for fused silica and 0.2 µm/min for sapphire with diamond. If the previous polish left a 1 µm subsurface-damage layer, removing 1 µm uniformly from a 100 mm part means 7.85 mm³, about 196 min at the BK7 volumetric rate of 0.04 mm³/min and roughly 12 times longer for sapphire, so hard materials must leave the grinding stage with a thinner damage layer.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「材料反應、磨料選擇與次表面損傷」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Material response, abrasive choice and subsurface damage\", which statement holds?","options":["磁流變拋光可以取代所有前段工序，直接從粗磨面修到最終面形。","磁流變拋光就是用磁鐵把磨料壓在工件上，去除量取決於壓力大小。","取教學假設的峰值去除率：BK7 2.4 µm/min、熔融石英 1.2 µm/min、藍寶石（鑽石磨料）0.2 µm/min。"],"optionsEn":["MRF can replace all earlier steps and figure a rough-ground surface directly to final shape.","MRF simply presses abrasive onto the part with a magnet, so removal depends on how hard it presses.","Take teaching-assumption peak rates of 2.4 µm/min for BK7, 1.2 µm/min for fused silica and 0.2 µm/min for sapphire with diamond."],"answer":2,"explanation":"取教學假設的峰值去除率：BK7 2.4 µm/min、熔融石英 1.2 µm/min、藍寶石（鑽石磨料）0.2 µm/min。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Take teaching-assumption peak rates of 2.4 µm/min for BK7, 1.2 µm/min for fused silica and 0.2 µm/min for sapphire with diamond. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a411-v12-15","title":"材料反應、磨料選擇與次表面損傷：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Material response, abrasive choice and subsurface damage: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「工件材料與次表面損傷層」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Workpiece material and subsurface-damage layer” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以磁流變點蝕法逐步加深去除點，用顯微鏡觀察點底部微裂紋消失的深度，直接量出次表面損傷層厚度；修形後以白光干涉儀量粗糙度與 PSD，與修形前比較，確認高頻段下降而非上升。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use the MRF spot-etch method, deepening a spot in steps and observing under a microscope the depth at which microcracks vanish, to measure the subsurface-damage thickness directly; after figuring, measure roughness and PSD with white-light interferometry and compare with the pre-run state to confirm the high-frequency band fell rather than rose. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把為玻璃配製的氧化鈰流體用在氟化鈣上，水基化學侵蝕晶面造成霧狀表面，粗糙度從 0.5 nm 升到 3 nm，散射超標而整批報廢。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Using a cerium-oxide fluid formulated for glass on calcium fluoride lets the aqueous chemistry attack the crystal face, leaving a hazy surface with roughness rising from 0.5 nm to 3 nm, failing scatter and scrapping the batch.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以磁流變點蝕法逐步加深去除點，用顯微鏡觀察點底部微裂紋消失的深度，直接量出次表面損傷層厚度；修形後以白光干涉儀量粗糙度與 PSD，與修形前比較，確認高頻段下降而非上升。","textEn":"Use the MRF spot-etch method, deepening a spot in steps and observing under a microscope the depth at which microcracks vanish, to measure the subsurface-damage thickness directly; after figuring, measure roughness and PSD with white-light interferometry and compare with the pre-run state to confirm the high-frequency band fell rather than rose.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「材料反應、磨料選擇與次表面損傷」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Material response, abrasive choice and subsurface damage\"?","options":["以磁流變點蝕法逐步加深去除點，用顯微鏡觀察點底部微裂紋消失的深度，直接量出次表面損傷層厚度。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","去除點只與流體有關，與工件曲率和浸入深度無關。"],"optionsEn":["Use the MRF spot-etch method, deepening a spot in steps and observing under a microscope the depth at which microcracks vanish, to measure the subsurface-damage thickness directly.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","The spot depends only on the fluid, not on part curvature or immersion depth."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以磁流變點蝕法逐步加深去除點，用顯微鏡觀察點底部微裂紋消失的深度，直接量出次表面損傷層厚度；修形後以白光干涉儀量粗糙度與 PSD，與修形前比較，確認高頻段下降而非上升。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use the MRF spot-etch method, deepening a spot in steps and observing under a microscope the depth at which microcracks vanish, to measure the subsurface-damage thickness directly; after figuring, measure roughness and PSD with white-light interferometry and compare with the pre-run state to confirm the high-frequency band fell rather than rose. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a411-v12-16","title":"材料反應、磨料選擇與次表面損傷：失效診斷","titleEn":"Material response, abrasive choice and subsurface damage: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「工件材料與次表面損傷層」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Workpiece material and subsurface-damage layer” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把為玻璃配製的氧化鈰流體用在氟化鈣上，水基化學侵蝕晶面造成霧狀表面，粗糙度從 0.5 nm 升到 3 nm，散射超標而整批報廢。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Using a cerium-oxide fluid formulated for glass on calcium fluoride lets the aqueous chemistry attack the crystal face, leaving a hazy surface with roughness rising from 0.5 nm to 3 nm, failing scatter and scrapping the batch. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：對軟質或水溶性晶體，流體的水基環境與化學作用必須另外評估，否則會出現腐蝕紋或霧化。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: For soft or water-soluble crystals the aqueous chemistry of the fluid must be assessed separately or etch texture and haze appear.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要是拋光，就一定會在表面下留下新的損傷層。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Any polishing process necessarily leaves a fresh damage layer beneath the surface.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把為玻璃配製的氧化鈰流體用在氟化鈣上，水基化學侵蝕晶面造成霧狀表面，粗糙度從 0.5 nm 升到 3 nm，散射超標而整批報廢。","textEn":"Using a cerium-oxide fluid formulated for glass on calcium fluoride lets the aqueous chemistry attack the crystal face, leaving a hazy surface with roughness rising from 0.5 nm to 3 nm, failing scatter and scrapping the batch.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「材料反應、磨料選擇與次表面損傷」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Material response, abrasive choice and subsurface damage\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","把為玻璃配製的氧化鈰流體用在氟化鈣上，水基化學侵蝕晶面造成霧狀表面，粗糙度從 0.5 nm 升到 3 nm，散射超標而整批報廢。","量測圖只要夠清晰就能直接送進駐留時間計算，對位和校正是可選步驟。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Using a cerium-oxide fluid formulated for glass on calcium fluoride lets the aqueous chemistry attack the crystal face, leaving a hazy surface with roughness rising from 0.5 nm to 3 nm, failing scatter and scrapping the batch.","A sharp measurement map can go straight into dwell-time calculation; registration and calibration are optional."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把為玻璃配製的氧化鈰流體用在氟化鈣上，水基化學侵蝕晶面造成霧狀表面，粗糙度從 0.5 nm 升到 3 nm，散射超標而整批報廢。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using a cerium-oxide fluid formulated for glass on calcium fluoride lets the aqueous chemistry attack the crystal face, leaving a hazy surface with roughness rising from 0.5 nm to 3 nm, failing scatter and scrapping the batch. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a411-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「面形量測、CGH 零檢與去除點校正」與「誤差預算、收斂率與軌跡紋理」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Figure metrology, CGH null test and spot calibration\" and \"Error budget, convergence ratio and tool-path texture\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a411-v12-17","title":"面形量測、CGH 零檢與去除點校正：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Figure metrology, CGH null test and spot calibration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「干涉儀與去除點校正紀錄」如何決定磁流變光學拋光的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Interferometer and spot-calibration record” determines the key performance of “Magnetorheological optical finishing”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"修形迴路的輸入是干涉儀的面形圖：球面用參考球面直接量，非球面需電腦全像（CGH）零檢鏡或子孔徑拼接，自由曲面則用拼接或輪廓儀。量測圖必須對位到機台座標，機台用工件邊緣與基準記號定位，位置誤差乘上局部斜率成為去除誤差。每次修形前先在工件本身或同材料試片上打一個去除點並量測，取得當天的峰值去除率與點形，去除率的日漂移通常為百分之幾，這就是校正不能省略的原因。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「干涉儀與去除點校正紀錄」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The loop's input is an interferometric map: spheres are measured against a reference sphere, aspheres need a computer-generated-hologram null or sub-aperture stitching, and freeforms use stitching or profilometry. The map must be registered to machine coordinates using the part edge and fiducials, since position error times local slope becomes removal error. Before each run a spot is made and measured on the part itself or a witness of the same material to obtain that day's peak rate and spot shape; day-to-day drift of a few percent is why calibration cannot be skipped. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Interferometer and spot-calibration record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：去除點 10 s 深 0.40 µm → 峰值去除率 40 nm/s；若當天量到 0.38 µm，去除率低 5%，不更新校正則 250 nm 的去除會少 12.5 nm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 10 s spot 0.40 µm deep gives a peak rate of 40 nm/s; if today's spot reads 0.38 µm the rate is 5% low, and leaving the calibration stale under-removes 12.5 nm of a 250 nm correction.","failure":"常見誤解：「量測圖只要夠清晰就能直接送進駐留時間計算，對位和校正是可選步驟。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A sharp measurement map can go straight into dwell-time calculation; registration and calibration are optional.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「干涉儀與去除點校正紀錄」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Interferometer and spot-calibration record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-17-k1","title":"面形量測、CGH 零檢與去除點校正","titleEn":"Figure metrology, CGH null test and spot calibration","text":"修形迴路的輸入是干涉儀的面形圖：球面用參考球面直接量，非球面需電腦全像（CGH）零檢鏡或子孔徑拼接，自由曲面則用拼接或輪廓儀。量測圖必須對位到機台座標，機台用工件邊緣與基準記號定位，位置誤差乘上局部斜率成為去除誤差。","textEn":"The loop's input is an interferometric map: spheres are measured against a reference sphere, aspheres need a computer-generated-hologram null or sub-aperture stitching, and freeforms use stitching or profilometry. The map must be registered to machine coordinates using the part edge and fiducials, since position error times local slope becomes removal error.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：量測圖只要夠清晰就能直接送進駐留時間計算，對位和校正是可選步驟。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A sharp measurement map can go straight into dwell-time calculation; registration and calibration are optional. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「面形量測、CGH 零檢與去除點校正」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Figure metrology, CGH null test and spot calibration\" is correct?","options":["量測圖只要夠清晰就能直接送進駐留時間計算，對位和校正是可選步驟。","只要 RMS 達標，面形圖裡的週期性紋理就不會影響成像。","修形迴路的輸入是干涉儀的面形圖：球面用參考球面直接量，非球面需電腦全像（CGH）零檢鏡或子孔徑拼接，自由曲面則用拼接或輪廓儀。"],"optionsEn":["A sharp measurement map can go straight into dwell-time calculation; registration and calibration are optional.","If the RMS meets specification, periodic texture in the map cannot affect imaging.","The loop's input is an interferometric map: spheres are measured against a reference sphere, aspheres need a computer-generated-hologram null or sub-aperture stitching, and freeforms use stitching or profilometry."],"answer":2,"explanation":"修形迴路的輸入是干涉儀的面形圖：球面用參考球面直接量，非球面需電腦全像（CGH）零檢鏡或子孔徑拼接，自由曲面則用拼接或輪廓儀。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The loop's input is an interferometric map: spheres are measured against a reference sphere, aspheres need a computer-generated-hologram null or sub-aperture stitching, and freeforms use stitching or profilometry. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a411-v12-18","title":"面形量測、CGH 零檢與去除點校正：定量估算","titleEn":"Figure metrology, CGH null test and spot calibration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「干涉儀與去除點校正紀錄」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Interferometer and spot-calibration record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：去除點 10 s 深 0.40 µm → 峰值去除率 40 nm/s；若當天量到 0.38 µm，去除率低 5%，不更新校正則 250 nm 的去除會少 12.5 nm。對位誤差 20 µm 乘上非球面邊緣局部斜率 0.5 µm/mm，造成 10 nm 誤差；干涉儀 16 幀平均重複性約 1 nm RMS，CGH 零檢的對準殘差另計 3 nm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 10 s spot 0.40 µm deep gives a peak rate of 40 nm/s; if today's spot reads 0.38 µm the rate is 5% low, and leaving the calibration stale under-removes 12.5 nm of a 250 nm correction. A 20 µm registration error times a local edge slope of 0.5 µm/mm on the asphere gives 10 nm; a 16-frame interferometer average repeats to about 1 nm RMS, with CGH alignment residual counted separately at 3 nm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用兩次獨立裝夾的量測相減估重複性；在 CGH 零檢中旋轉工件 90° 再量一次，把隨工件轉動的誤差與不轉的系統誤差分離；比較去除點的量測形狀與駐留軟體內建的點函數，形狀差異需小於 5%。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Estimate repeatability by subtracting two measurements with independent mounting; in the CGH null test rotate the part by 90° and re-measure to separate errors that rotate with the part from fixed systematic ones; compare the measured spot shape with the spot function stored in the dwell software, requiring agreement within 5%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"去除點 10 s 深 0.40 µm → 峰值去除率 40 nm/s；若當天量到 0.38 µm，去除率低 5%，不更新校正則 250 nm 的去除會少 12.5 nm。對位誤差 20 µm 乘上非球面邊緣局部斜率 0.5 µm/mm，造成 10 nm 誤差；干涉儀 16 幀平均重複性約 1 nm RMS，CGH 零檢的對準殘差另計 3 nm。","textEn":"A 10 s spot 0.40 µm deep gives a peak rate of 40 nm/s; if today's spot reads 0.38 µm the rate is 5% low, and leaving the calibration stale under-removes 12.5 nm of a 250 nm correction. A 20 µm registration error times a local edge slope of 0.5 µm/mm on the asphere gives 10 nm; a 16-frame interferometer average repeats to about 1 nm RMS, with CGH alignment residual counted separately at 3 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「面形量測、CGH 零檢與去除點校正」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Figure metrology, CGH null test and spot calibration\", which statement holds?","options":["去除點 10 s 深 0.40 µm → 峰值去除率 40 nm/s。","表面誤差數值就是波前誤差，透鏡與反射鏡的規格可以直接互換。","去除點只與流體有關，與工件曲率和浸入深度無關。"],"optionsEn":["A 10 s spot 0.40 µm deep gives a peak rate of 40 nm/s.","Surface error equals wavefront error, so lens and mirror specifications are interchangeable.","The spot depends only on the fluid, not on part curvature or immersion depth."],"answer":0,"explanation":"去除點 10 s 深 0.40 µm → 峰值去除率 40 nm/s；若當天量到 0.38 µm，去除率低 5%，不更新校正則 250 nm 的去除會少 12.5 nm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 10 s spot 0.40 µm deep gives a peak rate of 40 nm/s; if today's spot reads 0.38 µm the rate is 5% low, and leaving the calibration stale under-removes 12.5 nm of a 250 nm correction. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a411-v12-19","title":"面形量測、CGH 零檢與去除點校正：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Figure metrology, CGH null test and spot calibration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「干涉儀與去除點校正紀錄」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Interferometer and spot-calibration record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用兩次獨立裝夾的量測相減估重複性；在 CGH 零檢中旋轉工件 90° 再量一次，把隨工件轉動的誤差與不轉的系統誤差分離；比較去除點的量測形狀與駐留軟體內建的點函數，形狀差異需小於 5%。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Estimate repeatability by subtracting two measurements with independent mounting; in the CGH null test rotate the part by 90° and re-measure to separate errors that rotate with the part from fixed systematic ones; compare the measured spot shape with the spot function stored in the dwell software, requiring agreement within 5%. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：CGH 零檢鏡與干涉儀未對準，產生假的彗差被當成真實面形修掉，修形後實際面形多了一個相反的彗差項，而用另一台儀器驗收時才發現。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A misaligned CGH null produces false coma that is figured out as if it were real, so the finished surface carries a coma of opposite sign, discovered only when acceptance is run on a different instrument.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用兩次獨立裝夾的量測相減估重複性；在 CGH 零檢中旋轉工件 90° 再量一次，把隨工件轉動的誤差與不轉的系統誤差分離；比較去除點的量測形狀與駐留軟體內建的點函數，形狀差異需小於 5%。","textEn":"Estimate repeatability by subtracting two measurements with independent mounting; in the CGH null test rotate the part by 90° and re-measure to separate errors that rotate with the part from fixed systematic ones; compare the measured spot shape with the spot function stored in the dwell software, requiring agreement within 5%.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「面形量測、CGH 零檢與去除點校正」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Figure metrology, CGH null test and spot calibration\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","用兩次獨立裝夾的量測相減估重複性。","磁流變液像拋光粉一樣，配好以後就可以長期使用不必監控。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Estimate repeatability by subtracting two measurements with independent mounting.","MR fluid is like polishing slurry: once mixed it can be used for a long time without monitoring."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用兩次獨立裝夾的量測相減估重複性；在 CGH 零檢中旋轉工件 90° 再量一次，把隨工件轉動的誤差與不轉的系統誤差分離；比較去除點的量測形狀與駐留軟體內建的點函數，形狀差異需小於 5%。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Estimate repeatability by subtracting two measurements with independent mounting; in the CGH null test rotate the part by 90° and re-measure to separate errors that rotate with the part from fixed systematic ones; compare the measured spot shape with the spot function stored in the dwell software, requiring agreement within 5%. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a411-v12-20","title":"面形量測、CGH 零檢與去除點校正：失效診斷","titleEn":"Figure metrology, CGH null test and spot calibration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「干涉儀與去除點校正紀錄」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Interferometer and spot-calibration record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"CGH 零檢鏡與干涉儀未對準，產生假的彗差被當成真實面形修掉，修形後實際面形多了一個相反的彗差項，而用另一台儀器驗收時才發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A misaligned CGH null produces false coma that is figured out as if it were real, so the finished surface carries a coma of opposite sign, discovered only when acceptance is run on a different instrument. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：每次修形前先在工件本身或同材料試片上打一個去除點並量測，取得當天的峰值去除率與點形，去除率的日漂移通常為百分之幾，這就是校正不能省略的原因。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before each run a spot is made and measured on the part itself or a witness of the same material to obtain that day's peak rate and spot shape; day-to-day drift of a few percent is why calibration cannot be skipped.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「量測圖只要夠清晰就能直接送進駐留時間計算，對位和校正是可選步驟。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A sharp measurement map can go straight into dwell-time calculation; registration and calibration are optional.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"CGH 零檢鏡與干涉儀未對準，產生假的彗差被當成真實面形修掉，修形後實際面形多了一個相反的彗差項，而用另一台儀器驗收時才發現。","textEn":"A misaligned CGH null produces false coma that is figured out as if it were real, so the finished surface carries a coma of opposite sign, discovered only when acceptance is run on a different instrument.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「面形量測、CGH 零檢與去除點校正」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Figure metrology, CGH null test and spot calibration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","只要 RMS 達標，面形圖裡的週期性紋理就不會影響成像。","CGH 零檢鏡與干涉儀未對準，產生假的彗差被當成真實面形修掉，修形後實際面形多了一個相反的彗差項，而用另一台儀器驗收時才發現。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","If the RMS meets specification, periodic texture in the map cannot affect imaging.","A misaligned CGH null produces false coma that is figured out as if it were real, so the finished surface carries a coma of opposite sign, discovered only when acceptance is run on a different instrument."],"answer":2,"explanation":"CGH 零檢鏡與干涉儀未對準，產生假的彗差被當成真實面形修掉，修形後實際面形多了一個相反的彗差項，而用另一台儀器驗收時才發現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A misaligned CGH null produces false coma that is figured out as if it were real, so the finished surface carries a coma of opposite sign, discovered only when acceptance is run on a different instrument. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a411-v12-21","title":"誤差預算、收斂率與軌跡紋理：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Error budget, convergence ratio and tool-path texture: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「修形誤差預算與中頻紋理」如何決定磁流變光學拋光的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Figuring error budget and mid-frequency texture” determines the key performance of “Magnetorheological optical finishing”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"一次修形後的殘差由獨立項的均方根組成：去除率漂移乘以去除深度、量測重複性、對位誤差乘以斜率，以及去除點沿軌跡變化留下的中頻紋理。因為去除點寬度只有幾毫米，光柵或螺旋軌跡的步距若接近點寬會留下週期性波紋，步距小於點寬的一半時波紋被去除點本身平滑掉。磁流變拋光通常每次迭代可把低頻面形縮小 5 到 10 倍，但中頻紋理決定了收斂平台，必要時由後續小步距的「平滑」趟次或離子束處理。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「修形誤差預算與中頻紋理」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The post-run residual is the root-sum-square of independent terms: rate drift times removal depth, measurement repeatability, registration error times slope, and the mid-frequency texture left by spot variation along the path. Because the spot is only a few millimetres wide, a raster or spiral pitch close to the spot width leaves periodic ripple, while a pitch below half the spot width is smoothed by the spot itself. MRF typically shrinks low-frequency figure by 5 to 10 times per iteration, but mid-frequency texture sets the convergence floor, handled if needed by a fine-pitch smoothing pass or ion-beam finishing. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Figuring error budget and mid-frequency texture”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：第一次迭代：去除率 3%×250 nm = 7.5 nm、量測 1 nm、對位 1 nm、中頻紋理 3 nm，殘差 ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS，從 60 nm 起算縮小 7.3 倍。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: First iteration: rate 3%×250 nm = 7.5 nm, metrology 1 nm, registration 1 nm, mid-frequency texture 3 nm, residual ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS, a 7.3-fold reduction from 60 nm.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要 RMS 達標，面形圖裡的週期性紋理就不會影響成像。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the RMS meets specification, periodic texture in the map cannot affect imaging.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「修形誤差預算與中頻紋理」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Figuring error budget and mid-frequency texture”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-21-k1","title":"誤差預算、收斂率與軌跡紋理","titleEn":"Error budget, convergence ratio and tool-path texture","text":"一次修形後的殘差由獨立項的均方根組成：去除率漂移乘以去除深度、量測重複性、對位誤差乘以斜率，以及去除點沿軌跡變化留下的中頻紋理。因為去除點寬度只有幾毫米，光柵或螺旋軌跡的步距若接近點寬會留下週期性波紋，步距小於點寬的一半時波紋被去除點本身平滑掉。","textEn":"The post-run residual is the root-sum-square of independent terms: rate drift times removal depth, measurement repeatability, registration error times slope, and the mid-frequency texture left by spot variation along the path. Because the spot is only a few millimetres wide, a raster or spiral pitch close to the spot width leaves periodic ripple, while a pitch below half the spot width is smoothed by the spot itself.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要 RMS 達標，面形圖裡的週期性紋理就不會影響成像。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the RMS meets specification, periodic texture in the map cannot affect imaging. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「誤差預算、收斂率與軌跡紋理」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Error budget, convergence ratio and tool-path texture\" is correct?","options":["一次修形後的殘差由獨立項的均方根組成：去除率漂移乘以去除深度、量測重複性、對位誤差乘以斜率，以及去除點沿軌跡變化留下的中頻紋理。","只要 RMS 達標，面形圖裡的週期性紋理就不會影響成像。","磁流變拋光可以取代所有前段工序，直接從粗磨面修到最終面形。"],"optionsEn":["The post-run residual is the root-sum-square of independent terms: rate drift times removal depth, measurement repeatability, registration error times slope, and the mid-frequency texture left by spot variation along the path.","If the RMS meets specification, periodic texture in the map cannot affect imaging.","MRF can replace all earlier steps and figure a rough-ground surface directly to final shape."],"answer":0,"explanation":"一次修形後的殘差由獨立項的均方根組成：去除率漂移乘以去除深度、量測重複性、對位誤差乘以斜率，以及去除點沿軌跡變化留下的中頻紋理。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The post-run residual is the root-sum-square of independent terms: rate drift times removal depth, measurement repeatability, registration error times slope, and the mid-frequency texture left by spot variation along the path. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a411-v12-22","title":"誤差預算、收斂率與軌跡紋理：定量估算","titleEn":"Error budget, convergence ratio and tool-path texture: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「修形誤差預算與中頻紋理」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Figuring error budget and mid-frequency texture” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：第一次迭代：去除率 3%×250 nm = 7.5 nm、量測 1 nm、對位 1 nm、中頻紋理 3 nm，殘差 ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS，從 60 nm 起算縮小 7.3 倍。軌跡波紋：點寬 4 mm 視為 σ ≈ 1.7 mm 的平滑核，步距 1 mm 的波紋傳遞 exp(−2π²σ²f²) = exp(−57) ≈ 0，步距 3 mm 時 exp(−6.3) ≈ 0.002 仍可忽略，但步距 4 mm 以上開始可見。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: First iteration: rate 3%×250 nm = 7.5 nm, metrology 1 nm, registration 1 nm, mid-frequency texture 3 nm, residual ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS, a 7.3-fold reduction from 60 nm. Path ripple: treating the 4 mm spot as a smoothing kernel with σ ≈ 1.7 mm, a 1 mm pitch transmits exp(−2π²σ²f²) = exp(−57) ≈ 0, a 3 mm pitch exp(−6.3) ≈ 0.002, still negligible, but ripple becomes visible beyond a 4 mm pitch. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：修形後把殘差圖做二維 PSD，檢查步距對應頻率是否出現尖峰；把預算表中各項的預測值與實測殘差分解比較，若實測明顯高於預算，先查去除率日誌再查對位，不要盲目加迭代。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compute the two-dimensional PSD of the post-run residual and look for a peak at the pitch frequency; compare each budget term's prediction with the decomposed measured residual, and if the measurement is clearly above budget check the removal-rate log first, then registration, instead of blindly adding iterations.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"第一次迭代：去除率 3%×250 nm = 7.5 nm、量測 1 nm、對位 1 nm、中頻紋理 3 nm，殘差 ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS，從 60 nm 起算縮小 7.3 倍。軌跡波紋：點寬 4 mm 視為 σ ≈ 1.7 mm 的平滑核，步距 1 mm 的波紋傳遞 exp(−2π²σ²f²) = exp(−57) ≈ 0，步距 3 mm 時 exp(−6.3) ≈ 0.002 仍可忽略，但步距 4 mm 以上開始可見。","textEn":"First iteration: rate 3%×250 nm = 7.5 nm, metrology 1 nm, registration 1 nm, mid-frequency texture 3 nm, residual ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS, a 7.3-fold reduction from 60 nm. Path ripple: treating the 4 mm spot as a smoothing kernel with σ ≈ 1.7 mm, a 1 mm pitch transmits exp(−2π²σ²f²) = exp(−57) ≈ 0, a 3 mm pitch exp(−6.3) ≈ 0.002, still negligible, but ripple becomes visible beyond a 4 mm pitch.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「誤差預算、收斂率與軌跡紋理」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Error budget, convergence ratio and tool-path texture\", which statement holds?","options":["磁流變拋光就是用磁鐵把磨料壓在工件上，去除量取決於壓力大小。","第一次迭代：去除率 3%×250 nm = 7.5 nm、量測 1 nm、對位 1 nm、中頻紋理 3 nm，殘差 ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS，從 60 nm 起算縮小 7.3 倍。","磁流變液像拋光粉一樣，配好以後就可以長期使用不必監控。"],"optionsEn":["MRF simply presses abrasive onto the part with a magnet, so removal depends on how hard it presses.","First iteration: rate 3%×250 nm = 7.5 nm, metrology 1 nm, registration 1 nm, mid-frequency texture 3 nm, residual ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS, a 7.3-fold reduction from 60 nm.","MR fluid is like polishing slurry: once mixed it can be used for a long time without monitoring."],"answer":1,"explanation":"第一次迭代：去除率 3%×250 nm = 7.5 nm、量測 1 nm、對位 1 nm、中頻紋理 3 nm，殘差 ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS，從 60 nm 起算縮小 7.3 倍。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"First iteration: rate 3%×250 nm = 7.5 nm, metrology 1 nm, registration 1 nm, mid-frequency texture 3 nm, residual ≈ √(7.5² + 1² + 1² + 3²) ≈ 8.2 nm RMS, a 7.3-fold reduction from 60 nm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a411-v12-23","title":"誤差預算、收斂率與軌跡紋理：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Error budget, convergence ratio and tool-path texture: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「修形誤差預算與中頻紋理」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Figuring error budget and mid-frequency texture” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"修形後把殘差圖做二維 PSD，檢查步距對應頻率是否出現尖峰；把預算表中各項的預測值與實測殘差分解比較，若實測明顯高於預算，先查去除率日誌再查對位，不要盲目加迭代。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compute the two-dimensional PSD of the post-run residual and look for a peak at the pitch frequency; compare each budget term's prediction with the decomposed measured residual, and if the measurement is clearly above budget check the removal-rate log first, then registration, instead of blindly adding iterations. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了縮短時間把步距放大到與點寬相同，面上留下 4 mm 週期的波紋，干涉圖看似合格但 PSD 在 0.25 mm⁻¹ 出現尖峰，成像系統出現可見的鬼影與對比下降。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Widening the pitch to the spot width to save time leaves 4 mm period ripple; the interferogram looks acceptable but the PSD shows a spike at 0.25 mm⁻¹, and the imaging system shows ghost structure and reduced contrast.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"修形後把殘差圖做二維 PSD，檢查步距對應頻率是否出現尖峰；把預算表中各項的預測值與實測殘差分解比較，若實測明顯高於預算，先查去除率日誌再查對位，不要盲目加迭代。","textEn":"Compute the two-dimensional PSD of the post-run residual and look for a peak at the pitch frequency; compare each budget term's prediction with the decomposed measured residual, and if the measurement is clearly above budget check the removal-rate log first, then registration, instead of blindly adding iterations.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「誤差預算、收斂率與軌跡紋理」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Error budget, convergence ratio and tool-path texture\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","只要是拋光，就一定會在表面下留下新的損傷層。","修形後把殘差圖做二維 PSD，檢查步距對應頻率是否出現尖峰。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Any polishing process necessarily leaves a fresh damage layer beneath the surface.","Compute the two-dimensional PSD of the post-run residual and look for a peak at the pitch frequency."],"answer":2,"explanation":"修形後把殘差圖做二維 PSD，檢查步距對應頻率是否出現尖峰；把預算表中各項的預測值與實測殘差分解比較，若實測明顯高於預算，先查去除率日誌再查對位，不要盲目加迭代。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compute the two-dimensional PSD of the post-run residual and look for a peak at the pitch frequency; compare each budget term's prediction with the decomposed measured residual, and if the measurement is clearly above budget check the removal-rate log first, then registration, instead of blindly adding iterations. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a411-v12-24","title":"誤差預算、收斂率與軌跡紋理：失效診斷","titleEn":"Error budget, convergence ratio and tool-path texture: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「修形誤差預算與中頻紋理」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Figuring error budget and mid-frequency texture” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了縮短時間把步距放大到與點寬相同，面上留下 4 mm 週期的波紋，干涉圖看似合格但 PSD 在 0.25 mm⁻¹ 出現尖峰，成像系統出現可見的鬼影與對比下降。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Widening the pitch to the spot width to save time leaves 4 mm period ripple; the interferogram looks acceptable but the PSD shows a spike at 0.25 mm⁻¹, and the imaging system shows ghost structure and reduced contrast. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：磁流變拋光通常每次迭代可把低頻面形縮小 5 到 10 倍，但中頻紋理決定了收斂平台，必要時由後續小步距的「平滑」趟次或離子束處理。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: MRF typically shrinks low-frequency figure by 5 to 10 times per iteration, but mid-frequency texture sets the convergence floor, handled if needed by a fine-pitch smoothing pass or ion-beam finishing.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要 RMS 達標，面形圖裡的週期性紋理就不會影響成像。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the RMS meets specification, periodic texture in the map cannot affect imaging.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了縮短時間把步距放大到與點寬相同，面上留下 4 mm 週期的波紋，干涉圖看似合格但 PSD 在 0.25 mm⁻¹ 出現尖峰，成像系統出現可見的鬼影與對比下降。","textEn":"Widening the pitch to the spot width to save time leaves 4 mm period ripple; the interferogram looks acceptable but the PSD shows a spike at 0.25 mm⁻¹, and the imaging system shows ghost structure and reduced contrast.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「誤差預算、收斂率與軌跡紋理」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Error budget, convergence ratio and tool-path texture\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["為了縮短時間把步距放大到與點寬相同，面上留下 4 mm 週期的波紋，干涉圖看似合格但 PSD 在 0.25 mm⁻¹ 出現尖峰，成像系統出現可見的鬼影與對比下降。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","磁流變拋光可以取代所有前段工序，直接從粗磨面修到最終面形。"],"optionsEn":["Widening the pitch to the spot width to save time leaves 4 mm period ripple.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","MRF can replace all earlier steps and figure a rough-ground surface directly to final shape."],"answer":0,"explanation":"為了縮短時間把步距放大到與點寬相同，面上留下 4 mm 週期的波紋，干涉圖看似合格但 PSD 在 0.25 mm⁻¹ 出現尖峰，成像系統出現可見的鬼影與對比下降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Widening the pitch to the spot width to save time leaves 4 mm period ripple; the interferogram looks acceptable but the PSD shows a spike at 0.25 mm⁻¹, and the imaging system shows ghost structure and reduced contrast. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a411-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「與研磨拋光鏈整合、邊緣與清洗」與「規格換算、驗收與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Integration with the grind-polish chain, edges and cleaning\" and \"Specification conversion, acceptance and engineering handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a411-v12-25","title":"與研磨拋光鏈整合、邊緣與清洗：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Integration with the grind-polish chain, edges and cleaning: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「製程鏈、邊緣處理與清洗」如何決定磁流變光學拋光的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Process chain, edge handling and cleaning” determines the key performance of “Magnetorheological optical finishing”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"磁流變拋光接在精磨或傳統拋光之後：前段提供可量測的面形與受控的粗糙度，磁流變負責去除損傷層與確定性修形，之後視規格再接離子束。因為去除靠剪切流，工件邊緣沒有壓力式工具的塌邊，但軌跡仍需讓去除點完整越過邊緣以維持均勻性。修形後工件表面殘留鐵粒子與乾涸流體，必須在數分鐘內用去離子水沖洗並以適當清潔程序處理，否則鐵鏽斑與水痕會在鍍膜前留下缺陷；鏡片的斜面與邊緣也需檢查是否有流體殘留。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「製程鏈、邊緣處理與清洗」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"MRF follows fine grinding or conventional polishing: the earlier stages supply a measurable figure and controlled roughness, MRF removes the damage layer and performs deterministic figuring, and ion-beam finishing may follow depending on specification. Because removal is by shear flow there is no pressure-tool edge roll, but the path must still carry the spot fully across the edge for uniformity. After the run the surface holds iron particles and drying fluid; it must be rinsed with deionised water within minutes and cleaned by a suitable procedure, or rust spots and water marks become coating defects, and bevels and edges must be checked for trapped fluid. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Process chain, edge handling and cleaning”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：批量規劃：直徑 100 mm 的 BK7 非球面，每片平均去除 0.25 µm，體積 0.25×10⁻³ × 7854 ≈ 1.96 mm³，以 0.04 mm³/min 需約 49 min；邊緣越程讓掃描直徑從 100 增到 110 mm，面積增加 21%，約 59 min。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Batch planning: a 100 mm BK7 asphere needs a mean removal of 0.25 µm per part, a volume of 0.25×10⁻³ × 7854 ≈ 1.96 mm³, about 49 min at 0.04 mm³/min; extending the path for the edge grows the scanned diameter from 100 to 110 mm, 21% more area, about 59 min.","failure":"常見誤解：「磁流變拋光可以取代所有前段工序，直接從粗磨面修到最終面形。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"MRF can replace all earlier steps and figure a rough-ground surface directly to final shape.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「製程鏈、邊緣處理與清洗」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Process chain, edge handling and cleaning”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-25-k1","title":"與研磨拋光鏈整合、邊緣與清洗","titleEn":"Integration with the grind-polish chain, edges and cleaning","text":"磁流變拋光接在精磨或傳統拋光之後：前段提供可量測的面形與受控的粗糙度，磁流變負責去除損傷層與確定性修形，之後視規格再接離子束。因為去除靠剪切流，工件邊緣沒有壓力式工具的塌邊，但軌跡仍需讓去除點完整越過邊緣以維持均勻性。","textEn":"MRF follows fine grinding or conventional polishing: the earlier stages supply a measurable figure and controlled roughness, MRF removes the damage layer and performs deterministic figuring, and ion-beam finishing may follow depending on specification. Because removal is by shear flow there is no pressure-tool edge roll, but the path must still carry the spot fully across the edge for uniformity.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：磁流變拋光可以取代所有前段工序，直接從粗磨面修到最終面形。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: MRF can replace all earlier steps and figure a rough-ground surface directly to final shape. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「與研磨拋光鏈整合、邊緣與清洗」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Integration with the grind-polish chain, edges and cleaning\" is correct?","options":["磁流變拋光可以取代所有前段工序，直接從粗磨面修到最終面形。","磁流變拋光接在精磨或傳統拋光之後：前段提供可量測的面形與受控的粗糙度，磁流變負責去除損傷層與確定性修形，之後視規格再接離子束。","表面誤差數值就是波前誤差，透鏡與反射鏡的規格可以直接互換。"],"optionsEn":["MRF can replace all earlier steps and figure a rough-ground surface directly to final shape.","MRF follows fine grinding or conventional polishing: the earlier stages supply a measurable figure and controlled roughness, MRF removes the damage layer and performs deterministic figuring, and ion-beam finishing may follow depending on specification.","Surface error equals wavefront error, so lens and mirror specifications are interchangeable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"磁流變拋光接在精磨或傳統拋光之後：前段提供可量測的面形與受控的粗糙度，磁流變負責去除損傷層與確定性修形，之後視規格再接離子束。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"MRF follows fine grinding or conventional polishing: the earlier stages supply a measurable figure and controlled roughness, MRF removes the damage layer and performs deterministic figuring, and ion-beam finishing may follow depending on specification. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a411-v12-26","title":"與研磨拋光鏈整合、邊緣與清洗：定量估算","titleEn":"Integration with the grind-polish chain, edges and cleaning: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「製程鏈、邊緣處理與清洗」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Process chain, edge handling and cleaning” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：批量規劃：直徑 100 mm 的 BK7 非球面，每片平均去除 0.25 µm，體積 0.25×10⁻³ × 7854 ≈ 1.96 mm³，以 0.04 mm³/min 需約 49 min；邊緣越程讓掃描直徑從 100 增到 110 mm，面積增加 21%，約 59 min。20 片一批加上每日 15 min 去除點校正與每片 10 min 裝卸量測，總時間 ≈ 20×69 + 15 ≈ 1395 min ≈ 23 h。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Batch planning: a 100 mm BK7 asphere needs a mean removal of 0.25 µm per part, a volume of 0.25×10⁻³ × 7854 ≈ 1.96 mm³, about 49 min at 0.04 mm³/min; extending the path for the edge grows the scanned diameter from 100 to 110 mm, 21% more area, about 59 min. For a batch of 20 with 15 min of daily spot calibration and 10 min of loading and measurement per part, total ≈ 20×69 + 15 ≈ 1395 min ≈ 23 h. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：修形後立即以暗場顯微鏡檢查表面與斜面是否有鐵粒子殘留，清洗後再檢查一次；比較邊緣 5 mm 環帶與中央的殘差 RMS，確認越程策略有效；追蹤整批的修形時間與去除率日誌，驗證批量計畫的假設。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Inspect the surface and bevels under dark-field microscopy immediately after the run and again after cleaning for iron residue; compare residual RMS in the outer 5 mm annulus with the centre to confirm the overrun strategy; track run times and the removal-rate log across the batch to validate the planning assumptions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"批量規劃：直徑 100 mm 的 BK7 非球面，每片平均去除 0.25 µm，體積 0.25×10⁻³ × 7854 ≈ 1.96 mm³，以 0.04 mm³/min 需約 49 min；邊緣越程讓掃描直徑從 100 增到 110 mm，面積增加 21%，約 59 min。20 片一批加上每日 15 min 去除點校正與每片 10 min 裝卸量測，總時間 ≈ 20×69 + 15 ≈ 1395 min ≈ 23 h。","textEn":"Batch planning: a 100 mm BK7 asphere needs a mean removal of 0.25 µm per part, a volume of 0.25×10⁻³ × 7854 ≈ 1.96 mm³, about 49 min at 0.04 mm³/min; extending the path for the edge grows the scanned diameter from 100 to 110 mm, 21% more area, about 59 min. For a batch of 20 with 15 min of daily spot calibration and 10 min of loading and measurement per part, total ≈ 20×69 + 15 ≈ 1395 min ≈ 23 h.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「與研磨拋光鏈整合、邊緣與清洗」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Integration with the grind-polish chain, edges and cleaning\", which statement holds?","options":["去除點只與流體有關，與工件曲率和浸入深度無關。","只要是拋光，就一定會在表面下留下新的損傷層。","批量規劃：直徑 100 mm 的 BK7 非球面，每片平均去除 0.25 µm，體積 0.25×10⁻³ × 7854 ≈ 1.96 mm³，以 0.04 mm³/min 需約 49 min。"],"optionsEn":["The spot depends only on the fluid, not on part curvature or immersion depth.","Any polishing process necessarily leaves a fresh damage layer beneath the surface.","Batch planning: a 100 mm BK7 asphere needs a mean removal of 0.25 µm per part, a volume of 0.25×10⁻³ × 7854 ≈ 1.96 mm³, about 49 min at 0.04 mm³/min."],"answer":2,"explanation":"批量規劃：直徑 100 mm 的 BK7 非球面，每片平均去除 0.25 µm，體積 0.25×10⁻³ × 7854 ≈ 1.96 mm³，以 0.04 mm³/min 需約 49 min；邊緣越程讓掃描直徑從 100 增到 110 mm，面積增加 21%，約 59 min。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Batch planning: a 100 mm BK7 asphere needs a mean removal of 0.25 µm per part, a volume of 0.25×10⁻³ × 7854 ≈ 1.96 mm³, about 49 min at 0.04 mm³/min; extending the path for the edge grows the scanned diameter from 100 to 110 mm, 21% more area, about 59 min. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a411-v12-27","title":"與研磨拋光鏈整合、邊緣與清洗：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Integration with the grind-polish chain, edges and cleaning: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「製程鏈、邊緣處理與清洗」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Process chain, edge handling and cleaning” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"修形後立即以暗場顯微鏡檢查表面與斜面是否有鐵粒子殘留，清洗後再檢查一次；比較邊緣 5 mm 環帶與中央的殘差 RMS，確認越程策略有效；追蹤整批的修形時間與去除率日誌，驗證批量計畫的假設。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Inspect the surface and bevels under dark-field microscopy immediately after the run and again after cleaning for iron residue; compare residual RMS in the outer 5 mm annulus with the centre to confirm the overrun strategy; track run times and the removal-rate log across the batch to validate the planning assumptions. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：工件修完後放置過夜才清洗，乾涸的流體在表面留下鐵鏽斑與蝕痕，鍍膜後出現針孔缺陷；或邊緣越程不足，最外 3 mm 去除不足而留下上翹環帶。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Leaving a finished part overnight before cleaning lets dried fluid leave rust spots and etch marks that become pinholes after coating; insufficient edge overrun under-removes the outer 3 mm and leaves an upturned annulus.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"修形後立即以暗場顯微鏡檢查表面與斜面是否有鐵粒子殘留，清洗後再檢查一次；比較邊緣 5 mm 環帶與中央的殘差 RMS，確認越程策略有效；追蹤整批的修形時間與去除率日誌，驗證批量計畫的假設。","textEn":"Inspect the surface and bevels under dark-field microscopy immediately after the run and again after cleaning for iron residue; compare residual RMS in the outer 5 mm annulus with the centre to confirm the overrun strategy; track run times and the removal-rate log across the batch to validate the planning assumptions.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「與研磨拋光鏈整合、邊緣與清洗」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Integration with the grind-polish chain, edges and cleaning\"?","options":["修形後立即以暗場顯微鏡檢查表面與斜面是否有鐵粒子殘留，清洗後再檢查一次。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","量測圖只要夠清晰就能直接送進駐留時間計算，對位和校正是可選步驟。"],"optionsEn":["Inspect the surface and bevels under dark-field microscopy immediately after the run and again after cleaning for iron residue.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A sharp measurement map can go straight into dwell-time calculation; registration and calibration are optional."],"answer":0,"explanation":"修形後立即以暗場顯微鏡檢查表面與斜面是否有鐵粒子殘留，清洗後再檢查一次；比較邊緣 5 mm 環帶與中央的殘差 RMS，確認越程策略有效；追蹤整批的修形時間與去除率日誌，驗證批量計畫的假設。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Inspect the surface and bevels under dark-field microscopy immediately after the run and again after cleaning for iron residue; compare residual RMS in the outer 5 mm annulus with the centre to confirm the overrun strategy; track run times and the removal-rate log across the batch to validate the planning assumptions. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a411-v12-28","title":"與研磨拋光鏈整合、邊緣與清洗：失效診斷","titleEn":"Integration with the grind-polish chain, edges and cleaning: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「製程鏈、邊緣處理與清洗」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Process chain, edge handling and cleaning” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"工件修完後放置過夜才清洗，乾涸的流體在表面留下鐵鏽斑與蝕痕，鍍膜後出現針孔缺陷；或邊緣越程不足，最外 3 mm 去除不足而留下上翹環帶。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Leaving a finished part overnight before cleaning lets dried fluid leave rust spots and etch marks that become pinholes after coating; insufficient edge overrun under-removes the outer 3 mm and leaves an upturned annulus. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：修形後工件表面殘留鐵粒子與乾涸流體，必須在數分鐘內用去離子水沖洗並以適當清潔程序處理，否則鐵鏽斑與水痕會在鍍膜前留下缺陷；鏡片的斜面與邊緣也需檢查是否有流體殘留。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: After the run the surface holds iron particles and drying fluid; it must be rinsed with deionised water within minutes and cleaned by a suitable procedure, or rust spots and water marks become coating defects, and bevels and edges must be checked for trapped fluid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「磁流變拋光可以取代所有前段工序，直接從粗磨面修到最終面形。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"MRF can replace all earlier steps and figure a rough-ground surface directly to final shape.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"工件修完後放置過夜才清洗，乾涸的流體在表面留下鐵鏽斑與蝕痕，鍍膜後出現針孔缺陷；或邊緣越程不足，最外 3 mm 去除不足而留下上翹環帶。","textEn":"Leaving a finished part overnight before cleaning lets dried fluid leave rust spots and etch marks that become pinholes after coating; insufficient edge overrun under-removes the outer 3 mm and leaves an upturned annulus.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「與研磨拋光鏈整合、邊緣與清洗」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Integration with the grind-polish chain, edges and cleaning\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","工件修完後放置過夜才清洗，乾涸的流體在表面留下鐵鏽斑與蝕痕，鍍膜後出現針孔缺陷；或邊緣越程不足，最外 3 mm 去除不足而留下上翹環帶。","表面誤差數值就是波前誤差，透鏡與反射鏡的規格可以直接互換。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Leaving a finished part overnight before cleaning lets dried fluid leave rust spots and etch marks that become pinholes after coating.","Surface error equals wavefront error, so lens and mirror specifications are interchangeable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"工件修完後放置過夜才清洗，乾涸的流體在表面留下鐵鏽斑與蝕痕，鍍膜後出現針孔缺陷；或邊緣越程不足，最外 3 mm 去除不足而留下上翹環帶。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Leaving a finished part overnight before cleaning lets dried fluid leave rust spots and etch marks that become pinholes after coating; insufficient edge overrun under-removes the outer 3 mm and leaves an upturned annulus. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a411-v12-29","title":"規格換算、驗收與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Specification conversion, acceptance and engineering handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「驗收報告與穿透波前換算」如何決定磁流變光學拋光的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Acceptance report and transmitted-wavefront conversion” determines the key performance of “Magnetorheological optical finishing”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"透鏡表面誤差對穿透波前的影響是 (n − 1) 倍，反射面則是 2 倍，驗收前必須把表面 RMS 換算成系統要求的波前量，並註明是否扣除傾斜、離焦與使用的空間濾波。交接資料應包含最終面形圖與 Zernike 係數、分頻段 PSD、修形前後粗糙度、去除點校正紀錄、流體批號與黏度日誌、總去除深度與清洗紀錄，使鍍膜與組裝端能評估殘留風險。獨立儀器的複測是驗收的核心，而不是只核對機台自己的量測。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「驗收報告與穿透波前換算」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A lens surface error enters the transmitted wavefront (n − 1) times, a mirror surface 2 times, so before acceptance the surface RMS must be converted to the wavefront quantity the system requires, stating whether tilt and focus were removed and which spatial filter was used. The handoff package should contain the final map with Zernike coefficients, band-limited PSDs, roughness before and after, the spot-calibration record, fluid batch and viscosity log, total removal depth and cleaning record, so coating and assembly can judge residual risk. Re-measurement on an independent instrument is the core of acceptance, not a check of the machine's own data. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Acceptance report and transmitted-wavefront conversion”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：BK7 在 633 nm 的 n = 1.517，表面殘差 8.2 nm RMS 的穿透波前貢獻 = (1.517 − 1)×8.2 ≈ 4.2 nm RMS ≈ λ/150；同樣的表面若作為反射鏡則為 16.4 nm ≈ λ/39。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For BK7 at 633 nm, n = 1.517, so a surface residual of 8.2 nm RMS contributes (1.517 − 1)×8.2 ≈ 4.2 nm RMS ≈ λ/150 to the transmitted wavefront; the same surface used as a mirror would give 16.4 nm ≈ λ/39.","failure":"常見誤解：「表面誤差數值就是波前誤差，透鏡與反射鏡的規格可以直接互換。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Surface error equals wavefront error, so lens and mirror specifications are interchangeable.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「驗收報告與穿透波前換算」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Acceptance report and transmitted-wavefront conversion”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-29-k1","title":"規格換算、驗收與工程交接","titleEn":"Specification conversion, acceptance and engineering handoff","text":"透鏡表面誤差對穿透波前的影響是 (n − 1) 倍，反射面則是 2 倍，驗收前必須把表面 RMS 換算成系統要求的波前量，並註明是否扣除傾斜、離焦與使用的空間濾波。交接資料應包含最終面形圖與 Zernike 係數、分頻段 PSD、修形前後粗糙度、去除點校正紀錄、流體批號與黏度日誌、總去除深度與清洗紀錄，使鍍膜與組裝端能評估殘留風險。","textEn":"A lens surface error enters the transmitted wavefront (n − 1) times, a mirror surface 2 times, so before acceptance the surface RMS must be converted to the wavefront quantity the system requires, stating whether tilt and focus were removed and which spatial filter was used. The handoff package should contain the final map with Zernike coefficients, band-limited PSDs, roughness before and after, the spot-calibration record, fluid batch and viscosity log, total removal depth and cleaning record, so coating and assembly can judge residual risk.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：表面誤差數值就是波前誤差，透鏡與反射鏡的規格可以直接互換。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Surface error equals wavefront error, so lens and mirror specifications are interchangeable. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「規格換算、驗收與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Specification conversion, acceptance and engineering handoff\" is correct?","options":["表面誤差數值就是波前誤差，透鏡與反射鏡的規格可以直接互換。","磁流變拋光就是用磁鐵把磨料壓在工件上，去除量取決於壓力大小。","透鏡表面誤差對穿透波前的影響是 (n − 1) 倍，反射面則是 2 倍，驗收前必須把表面 RMS 換算成系統要求的波前量，並註明是否扣除傾斜、離焦與使用的空間濾波。"],"optionsEn":["Surface error equals wavefront error, so lens and mirror specifications are interchangeable.","MRF simply presses abrasive onto the part with a magnet, so removal depends on how hard it presses.","A lens surface error enters the transmitted wavefront (n − 1) times, a mirror surface 2 times, so before acceptance the surface RMS must be converted to the wavefront quantity the system requires, stating whether tilt and focus were removed and which spatial filter was used."],"answer":2,"explanation":"透鏡表面誤差對穿透波前的影響是 (n − 1) 倍，反射面則是 2 倍，驗收前必須把表面 RMS 換算成系統要求的波前量，並註明是否扣除傾斜、離焦與使用的空間濾波。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A lens surface error enters the transmitted wavefront (n − 1) times, a mirror surface 2 times, so before acceptance the surface RMS must be converted to the wavefront quantity the system requires, stating whether tilt and focus were removed and which spatial filter was used. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a411-v12-30","title":"規格換算、驗收與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Specification conversion, acceptance and engineering handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「驗收報告與穿透波前換算」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Acceptance report and transmitted-wavefront conversion” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：BK7 在 633 nm 的 n = 1.517，表面殘差 8.2 nm RMS 的穿透波前貢獻 = (1.517 − 1)×8.2 ≈ 4.2 nm RMS ≈ λ/150；同樣的表面若作為反射鏡則為 16.4 nm ≈ λ/39。若系統分配給此面的波前預算為 λ/100 = 6.3 nm，則表面允許 6.3/0.517 ≈ 12.2 nm RMS，8.2 nm 的結果合格並留有 30% 餘裕。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For BK7 at 633 nm, n = 1.517, so a surface residual of 8.2 nm RMS contributes (1.517 − 1)×8.2 ≈ 4.2 nm RMS ≈ λ/150 to the transmitted wavefront; the same surface used as a mirror would give 16.4 nm ≈ λ/39. If the system allocates λ/100 = 6.3 nm of wavefront to this surface, the surface may carry 6.3/0.517 ≈ 12.2 nm RMS, so the 8.2 nm result passes with 30% margin. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用第二台干涉儀或不同的 CGH 複測最終面形，兩者差異需小於規格的五分之一；把透鏡裝入組件後量穿透波前，與 (n − 1) 換算值比較；檢查交接資料中所有數值的濾波、對位與波長條件一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Re-measure the final figure on a second interferometer or with a different CGH, requiring agreement within one fifth of specification; after mounting, measure the transmitted wavefront and compare with the (n − 1) conversion; check that filtering, registration and wavelength conditions are consistent across every number in the package.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"BK7 在 633 nm 的 n = 1.517，表面殘差 8.2 nm RMS 的穿透波前貢獻 = (1.517 − 1)×8.2 ≈ 4.2 nm RMS ≈ λ/150；同樣的表面若作為反射鏡則為 16.4 nm ≈ λ/39。若系統分配給此面的波前預算為 λ/100 = 6.3 nm，則表面允許 6.3/0.517 ≈ 12.2 nm RMS，8.2 nm 的結果合格並留有 30% 餘裕。","textEn":"For BK7 at 633 nm, n = 1.517, so a surface residual of 8.2 nm RMS contributes (1.517 − 1)×8.2 ≈ 4.2 nm RMS ≈ λ/150 to the transmitted wavefront; the same surface used as a mirror would give 16.4 nm ≈ λ/39. If the system allocates λ/100 = 6.3 nm of wavefront to this surface, the surface may carry 6.3/0.517 ≈ 12.2 nm RMS, so the 8.2 nm result passes with 30% margin.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「規格換算、驗收與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Specification conversion, acceptance and engineering handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["BK7 在 633 nm 的 n = 1.517，表面殘差 8.2 nm RMS 的穿透波前貢獻 = (1.517 − 1)×8.2 ≈ 4.2 nm RMS ≈ λ/150。","磁流變液像拋光粉一樣，配好以後就可以長期使用不必監控。","量測圖只要夠清晰就能直接送進駐留時間計算，對位和校正是可選步驟。"],"optionsEn":["For BK7 at 633 nm, n = 1.517, so a surface residual of 8.2 nm RMS contributes (1.517 − 1)×8.2 ≈ 4.2 nm RMS ≈ λ/150 to the transmitted wavefront.","MR fluid is like polishing slurry: once mixed it can be used for a long time without monitoring.","A sharp measurement map can go straight into dwell-time calculation; registration and calibration are optional."],"answer":0,"explanation":"BK7 在 633 nm 的 n = 1.517，表面殘差 8.2 nm RMS 的穿透波前貢獻 = (1.517 − 1)×8.2 ≈ 4.2 nm RMS ≈ λ/150；同樣的表面若作為反射鏡則為 16.4 nm ≈ λ/39。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For BK7 at 633 nm, n = 1.517, so a surface residual of 8.2 nm RMS contributes (1.517 − 1)×8.2 ≈ 4.2 nm RMS ≈ λ/150 to the transmitted wavefront; the same surface used as a mirror would give 16.4 nm ≈ λ/39. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a411-v12-31","title":"規格換算、驗收與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Specification conversion, acceptance and engineering handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「驗收報告與穿透波前換算」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Acceptance report and transmitted-wavefront conversion” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用第二台干涉儀或不同的 CGH 複測最終面形，兩者差異需小於規格的五分之一；把透鏡裝入組件後量穿透波前，與 (n − 1) 換算值比較；檢查交接資料中所有數值的濾波、對位與波長條件一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Re-measure the final figure on a second interferometer or with a different CGH, requiring agreement within one fifth of specification; after mounting, measure the transmitted wavefront and compare with the (n − 1) conversion; check that filtering, registration and wavelength conditions are consistent across every number in the package. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把反射量測的表面誤差直接當成穿透波前報出，數值被高估兩倍而讓合格件被退回；或缺少流體批號與去除點紀錄，日後同型件失效時無法分辨是流體老化還是量測問題。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Reporting a reflection-measured surface error directly as transmitted wavefront overstates it twofold and rejects a good part; missing fluid-batch and spot records later make it impossible to tell fluid ageing from a metrology problem when a similar part fails.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用第二台干涉儀或不同的 CGH 複測最終面形，兩者差異需小於規格的五分之一；把透鏡裝入組件後量穿透波前，與 (n − 1) 換算值比較；檢查交接資料中所有數值的濾波、對位與波長條件一致。","textEn":"Re-measure the final figure on a second interferometer or with a different CGH, requiring agreement within one fifth of specification; after mounting, measure the transmitted wavefront and compare with the (n − 1) conversion; check that filtering, registration and wavelength conditions are consistent across every number in the package.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「規格換算、驗收與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Specification conversion, acceptance and engineering handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","用第二台干涉儀或不同的 CGH 複測最終面形，兩者差異需小於規格的五分之一。","只要 RMS 達標，面形圖裡的週期性紋理就不會影響成像。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Re-measure the final figure on a second interferometer or with a different CGH, requiring agreement within one fifth of specification.","If the RMS meets specification, periodic texture in the map cannot affect imaging."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用第二台干涉儀或不同的 CGH 複測最終面形，兩者差異需小於規格的五分之一；把透鏡裝入組件後量穿透波前，與 (n − 1) 換算值比較；檢查交接資料中所有數值的濾波、對位與波長條件一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Re-measure the final figure on a second interferometer or with a different CGH, requiring agreement within one fifth of specification; after mounting, measure the transmitted wavefront and compare with the (n − 1) conversion; check that filtering, registration and wavelength conditions are consistent across every number in the package. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a411-v12-32","title":"規格換算、驗收與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Specification conversion, acceptance and engineering handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"prerequisiteIds":["a411-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「驗收報告與穿透波前換算」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Acceptance report and transmitted-wavefront conversion” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把反射量測的表面誤差直接當成穿透波前報出，數值被高估兩倍而讓合格件被退回；或缺少流體批號與去除點紀錄，日後同型件失效時無法分辨是流體老化還是量測問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Reporting a reflection-measured surface error directly as transmitted wavefront overstates it twofold and rejects a good part; missing fluid-batch and spot records later make it impossible to tell fluid ageing from a metrology problem when a similar part fails. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：獨立儀器的複測是驗收的核心，而不是只核對機台自己的量測。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Re-measurement on an independent instrument is the core of acceptance, not a check of the machine's own data.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「表面誤差數值就是波前誤差，透鏡與反射鏡的規格可以直接互換。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Surface error equals wavefront error, so lens and mirror specifications are interchangeable.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a411-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把反射量測的表面誤差直接當成穿透波前報出，數值被高估兩倍而讓合格件被退回；或缺少流體批號與去除點紀錄，日後同型件失效時無法分辨是流體老化還是量測問題。","textEn":"Reporting a reflection-measured surface error directly as transmitted wavefront overstates it twofold and rejects a good part; missing fluid-batch and spot records later make it impossible to tell fluid ageing from a metrology problem when a similar part fails.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]},{"id":"a411-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「規格換算、驗收與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Specification conversion, acceptance and engineering handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","磁流變拋光就是用磁鐵把磨料壓在工件上，去除量取決於壓力大小。","把反射量測的表面誤差直接當成穿透波前報出，數值被高估兩倍而讓合格件被退回；或缺少流體批號與去除點紀錄，日後同型件失效時無法分辨是流體老化還是量測問題。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","MRF simply presses abrasive onto the part with a magnet, so removal depends on how hard it presses.","Reporting a reflection-measured surface error directly as transmitted wavefront overstates it twofold and rejects a good part."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把反射量測的表面誤差直接當成穿透波前報出，數值被高估兩倍而讓合格件被退回；或缺少流體批號與去除點紀錄，日後同型件失效時無法分辨是流體老化還是量測問題。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Reporting a reflection-measured surface error directly as transmitted wavefront overstates it twofold and rejects a good part; missing fluid-batch and spot records later make it impossible to tell fluid ageing from a metrology problem when a similar part fails. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-lle-review-v63-mrf","v12o-rochester-news-mrf-award-2001","v12o-qed-technologies-site"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
